<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">1 Taarike Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Taarike Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Taari</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Taarike</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Taarike Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Taarike maxaafati, Sameela maxaafanne Kawota maxaafan de7iya taariketara guuthara gahetikoka, Isra7eele di7etethaafe sinthe de7iya hanotata dumma ogera qoncisosona. Taarike maxaafatan Isra7eele kawota ayso taarikey nam7u ayfe qofata birshidi odees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Shempo 1-9 gakanaw de7iya kifiliyan, Addaamepe Abrahaame gakanaw, Abrahaamepe Dawita gakanaw, Dawitape Babiloone di7uwa gakanaw de7iya Isra7eele wozetetha taarike odees. Asa na7a taarikey doometida wodepe doomidi di7ope guye de7iya wode gakanaw Xoossay ba asaa waatidi dooridakonne naagidaako ha kifiley odees. Isra7eelenne Yihuda kawotethati nagara oothikoka, Xoossay ba asaas gelida ufaysa qaala Yihuda kocha baggara polidaysa ha kifiley bessees.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Shempo 10-29 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, Dawita kawotetha taarikiya oykis. Ha kifiliyan Dawitara de7iya mino asatinne (shem 11-12), Dawiti xoonida wolqaama xoonoti (14:18-20) sintha bessi demmidosona. Dawita wode de7iya Leeweti, kahinetinne zammaareti gita sunthu ekidosona (shem 23-26). Xoossa keetha keexiday Solomone gidikoka, xoossa keethan goyinno wogaa koyro essiday Dawita gideysa ha kifiley erisees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Addaame kochay kawa Saa7ola gakanaw <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-10:14">1:1—10:14</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawita kawotuwanne Yerusalaame oyketetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-12:40">11:1—12:40</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Caaqo taabotey Yerusalaame yuussaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-17:27">13:1—17:27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawita xoonotanne asaa taybuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-21:30">18:1—21:30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawiti xoossa keethi keexanaw giigetetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1CH 22:1-29:20">22:1—29:20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Solomone kawotuwanne Dawita hayquwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1CH 29:21-30">29:21-30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Addaamepe Abrahaame Gakanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Medhe 5:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">11:10-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1"/>Addaamey Seeta yelis; Seeti Henoosa yelis; Henoosi Qaynana yelis; <verse eid="1CH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2"/>Qaynani Malal7eela yelis; Malal7eeli Yaareda yelis; <verse eid="1CH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3"/>Yaaredi Heenoke yelis; Heenokey Matusaala yelis; Matusaali Laameha yelis; <verse eid="1CH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4"/>Laamehi Nohe yelis; Nohey Seema, Kaamanne Yaafeta yelis.<verse eid="1CH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5"/>Yaafeta adde nayti Gamera, Maagoge, Madaya, Yawaana, Tobeela, Mosahanne Tirasa. <verse eid="1CH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6"/>Gamera adde nayti Askanaaza, Irfatanne Tegarma. <verse eid="1CH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7"/>Yawaana adde nayti Elisa, Tarsesa, Kiximanne Rooda.<verse eid="1CH 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8"/>Kaama adde nayti Kuusha, Mixirayma, Fuuxanne Kanaane. <verse eid="1CH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9"/>Kuusha adde nayti Saaba, Ewulaaxe, Sabita, Ra7imanne Sabqata. Ra7ima adde nayti Saabanne Didaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10"/>Kuushi Namiruude yelis. Namiruudey biitta bolla wolqaama olancho gidis. <verse eid="1CH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11"/>Mixiraymi Luudeta, Anamimeta, Lahabeta, Naftuheta, <verse eid="1CH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12"/>Patroosata, Filisxeemeta, mayza gidida Kasluheematanne Qaftooreta kochata mayza. <verse eid="1CH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13"/>Kanaaney bayra na7aa Sidoonanne iya kaaluwa Heeta yelis. <verse eid="1CH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14"/>Kanaaney Yaabuseta, Amooreta, Gergeseta, <verse eid="1CH 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15"/>Hiweta, Arketa, Siinata, <verse eid="1CH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16"/>Ardaaweta, Samaaretanne Hamaateta yelis.<verse eid="1CH 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17"/>Seema adde nayti Elama, Asoore, Arfakisaade, Luude, Araama, Uxi, Hula, Geteranne Mosaha. <verse eid="1CH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18"/>Arfakisaadi Saala yelis; Saali Eboora yelis. <verse eid="1CH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19"/>Eboori nam7u nayta yelis; issoy yeletida wode sa7i shaaketida gisho iya sunthay Faleqa geetetis; iya ishaa sunthay Yoqxaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20"/>Yoqxaani Almodaada, Salefa, Hazarmoota, Yaraha, <verse eid="1CH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21"/>Hadoraama, Uzaala, Diqila, <verse eid="1CH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22"/>Obaala, Abmaala, Saaba, <verse eid="1CH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23"/>Ofira, Awulaxanne Yobaaba yelis. Haysati Yoqxaana kochata.<verse eid="1CH 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24"/>Seemape Abrahaame gakanaw de7iya yeletay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata; Seema, Arfakisaade, Saala, <verse eid="1CH 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25"/>Eboora, Faleqa, Raga, <verse eid="1CH 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26"/>Saruga, Nakoora, Taaranne <verse eid="1CH 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27"/>Abrahaame geetetiya Abrame.<verse eid="1CH 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isma7eela Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Medhe 25:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28"/>Abrahaame adde nayti Yisaaqanne Isma7eela. <verse eid="1CH 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29"/>Enta yeletay haysafe kaallidi xaafetis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:29">Isma7eela bayra na7ay Nabayoota; hessafe kallidi, Qedaare, Adbeela, Mibsaama, <verse eid="1CH 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30"/>Misima, Duma, Masa, Kudane, Teema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31"/>Ixura, Nafisanne Qedima yelis. Haysati Isma7eela nayta.<verse eid="1CH 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32"/>Abrahaamey Keexurape yelida adde nayti Zimiraana, Yoqsaana, Madaane, Midiyaame, Yasboqanne Siwa. Yoqsaana adde nayti Saabanne Didaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33"/>Midiyaame adde nayti Gefera, Efera, Henooha, Abidanne Elda. Haysati Keexura kochata.<verse eid="1CH 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eesawe Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:1-19">Medhe 36:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34"/>Abrahaamey Yisaaqa yelis. Yisaaqa adde nayti Eesawenne Isra7eele. <verse eid="1CH 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35"/>Eesawe adde nayti Elfaaza, Ragu7eela, Ye7usa, Ya7ilamanne Qore. <verse eid="1CH 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36"/>Elfaaza adde nayti Temaana, Omaara, Sifo, Gotoma, Qeneza, Timinanne Amaaleqa. <verse eid="1CH 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37"/>Ragu7eela adde nayti Nahoota, Zaara, Saamanne Miza.<verse eid="1CH 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Edoomen De7ida Sayre Asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:20-30">Medhe 36:20-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38"/>Edoomen koyro de7ida Sayre adde nayti Looxane, Sobaala, Ziba7oona, Ana, Disoona, Exeranne Disaana. <verse eid="1CH 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39"/>Looxane adde nayti Hooranne Hemaama; Looxane michiya Timnaa7o. <verse eid="1CH 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40"/>Sobaala adde nayti Aliwa, Manahoota, Ebaala, Sifanne Onaama. Xiba7oona adde nayti Ayanne Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41"/>Ana na7ay Disoona. Disoona adde nayti Hemdaana, Esbaana, Yitraananne Kaarana. <verse eid="1CH 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42"/>Exera adde nayti Bilihaana, Zawananne Aqana. Disaana adde nayti Uxanne Arana.<verse eid="1CH 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Edoome Kawota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:31-43">Medhe 36:31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43"/>Isra7eelen kawoy kawotanaape kase Edoome biittan kawotida kawoti haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:43">Bi7oora na7ay Balaaqi kawotis; iya katamaa sunthay Dinaaba.<verse eid="1CH 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44"/>Balaaqi hayqin, Baasora addey Zaara na7ay Yobaabi iya bessan kawotis.<verse eid="1CH 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45"/>Yobaabi hayqin, Temaana addey Husami iya bessan kawotis.<verse eid="1CH 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46"/>Husami hayqin, Moo7abe biittan Midiyaameta xoonida Badada na7ay Hadaadi iya bessan kawotis; iya katamaa sunthay Awiita.<verse eid="1CH 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47"/>Hadaadi hayqin, Masreeqa addey Samili iya bessan kawotis.<verse eid="1CH 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48"/>Samili hayqin, shaafa matan de7iya Rehoboota addey Saa7uli iya bessan kawotis.<verse eid="1CH 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49"/>Saa7uli hayqin, Akboora na7ay Ba7al-Hanani iya bessan kawotis.<verse eid="1CH 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50"/>Ba7al-Hanani hayqin, Hadaadi iya bessan kawotis; iya katamaa sunthay Paa7u. Iya machiya Mezahaaba na7e Maxireedi na7iw Mahexabeelo. Hessafe guye, Hadaadi hayqis.<verse eid="1CH 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51"/>Edoome kochata halaqati haysata; Timnaa7a, Aliwa, Yeteta, <verse eid="1CH 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52"/>Oholbaama, Ela, Pinoona, <verse eid="1CH 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53"/>Qanaza, Temaana, Mibsaara, <verse eid="1CH 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54"/>Magdelanne Irama. Haysati Edoome halaqata.<verse eid="1CH 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1"/>Isra7eele adde nayti haysata; Robeela, Simoona, Leewe, Yihuda, Yisakoora, Zabloona, <verse eid="1CH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2"/>Daane, Yoosefa, Biniyaame, Niftaaleme, Gaadenne Aseera.<verse eid="1CH 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3"/>Kanaane maccase Sewape Yihudi yelida heedzu adde nayti Era, Onaananne Seela. Yihuda bayra na7ay Eri Godaa sinthan iitabaa oothida gisho Goday iya wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4"/>Yihudi ba na7aa mache Timaaripe Faaresanne Zaara yelis. Yihudas ichashu adde nayti de7oosona.<verse eid="1CH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5"/>Faaresa adde nayti Hesiroomanne Hamuula.<verse eid="1CH 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6"/>Zaara adde nayti Zimira, Etaana, Hemaana, Kalkolanne Dara; enti kumethi ichasha. <verse eid="1CH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7"/>Zaara koche gidida Karma na7ay Akaani Xoossas dummatida di7uwape kaysotidi Isra7eele asaa un7ethidaysa. <verse eid="1CH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8"/>Etaana na7ay Azaara.<verse eid="1CH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esroomepe Dawita Gakanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9"/>Hesrooni yelida nayti Yiram7eela, Araamenne Kaaleba. <verse eid="1CH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10"/>Araami Amnadaabe yelis. Amnadaabey Yihuda kochata halaqa Na7asoona yelis. <verse eid="1CH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11"/>Na7asooni Salmoona yelis; Salmooni Boo7eza yelis; <verse eid="1CH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12"/>Boo7ezi Iyyobeda yelis; Iyyobedi Isseye yelis. <verse eid="1CH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13"/>Isseyey ba bayra na7aa Eliyaaba, kaalo na7aa Amnadaabe, heedzantho na7aa Saama, <verse eid="1CH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14"/>oyddantho na7aa Natina7eela, ichashantho na7aa Radaya, <verse eid="1CH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15"/>usupuntho na7aa Asama, laapuntho na7aa Dawita yelis. <verse eid="1CH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16"/>Isseye macca nayti Xaruyonne Abigiya. Xaruyi nayti heedzati Abisaya, Iyo7aabanne Asaheela. <verse eid="1CH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17"/>Abigiya Amaasa yelasu; Amaasa aaway Isma7eela addiya Yetera.<verse eid="1CH 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esroome Sheesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18"/>Hesiroona na7aa Kaalebas Azuubonne Yir7ooto geetetiya nam7u macheti de7oosona. I Azuubipe Yesaara, Sobaabanne Ardoona yelis. <verse eid="1CH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19"/>Azuubi hayqin, Kaalebi Efraato ekis; Efraata Huura yelasu. <verse eid="1CH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20"/>Huuri Ure yelis; Urey Basli7eela yelis.<verse eid="1CH 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21"/>Hesiroonas laythi usupun tammu gidin, Galada aawa Makira na7iw ekidi Saguba yelis. <verse eid="1CH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22"/>Sagubi Ya7ira yelis. Ya7iri Galada biittan de7iya laatamanne heedzu katamata haaris. <verse eid="1CH 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23"/>Shin Geshuranne Soore kawoti Ya7ira katamata Qanaatanne iya yuushuwan de7iya usupun tammu katamata olidi oykidosona; yan de7iya asa ubbay Galada aawa Makira koche. <verse eid="1CH 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24"/>Hesrooni Kaaleba Efraata geetetiya bessan hayqidaape guye, Hesiroona machiya Abiya Tequhe aawa Ashihuura yelasu.<verse eid="1CH 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yirma7eela Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25"/>Hesiroona bayra na7aa Yirama7eela bayra na7ay Rama; kaaloti Buna, Orena, Oxeemanne Akiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26"/>Yirahim7eelas Ataaro geetetiya hara macha de7awusu; Ataara Onaama aayiw.<verse eid="1CH 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27"/>Yirama7eela bayra na7aa Rama nayti Ma7asa, Yaaminanne Eqera.<verse eid="1CH 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28"/>Onaama nayti Shamayanne Yada.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:28">Samaye nayti Naadabenne Abisura. <verse eid="1CH 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29"/>Abisura machiya Abikaala Ahbaananne Molida yelasu. <verse eid="1CH 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30"/>Nadaaba adde nayti Selidanne Afayma; Selidi na7a yelonna hayqis. <verse eid="1CH 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31"/>Afayma na7ay Yishi7a; Yishi7a na7ay Soosana; Soosana na7ay Ahilaya.<verse eid="1CH 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32"/>Shamaya ishaa Yada nayti Yeteranne Yoonataana; Yeteri na7a yelonna hayqis. <verse eid="1CH 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33"/>Yoonataana nayti Felitanne Zaaza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:33">Haysati Yirama7eela kochata.<verse eid="1CH 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34"/>Soosanas macca na7ape attishin, adde na7i baawa. Soosanas Iyoheela geetetiya Gibxefe aylley de7ees. <verse eid="1CH 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35"/>Soosani ba na7iw ba aylliya Iyoheelas immin, Ataya na7a yelasu. <verse eid="1CH 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36"/>Atayi Naatana yelis; Naatani Zabada yelis; <verse eid="1CH 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37"/>Zabadi Eflaala yelis; Eflaali Obeeda yelis; <verse eid="1CH 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38"/>Obeedi Iyyu yelis; Iyyuy Azaara yelis; <verse eid="1CH 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39"/>Azaariyasi Kelesa yelis; Kelesi El7aasa yelis; <verse eid="1CH 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40"/>El7aasi Sisimaya yelis; <verse eid="1CH 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41"/>Sisimayi Salooma yelis; Saloomi Yiqaama yelis; Yiqaami Elisaama yelis.<verse eid="1CH 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaaleba Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42"/>Yirama7eela ishaa Kaaleba bayra na7ay Moosa. Moosa na7ay Ziifa; Ziifa na7ay Mereesa; Mereesa na7ay Kebroona. <verse eid="1CH 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43"/>Kebroona nayti Qoraha, Tefuwa, Reqeemanne Shamaya. <verse eid="1CH 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44"/>Shamayey Yorqa7aama aawa Rahaama yelis. Reqeemi Shamaya yelis. <verse eid="1CH 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45"/>Shamaya na7ay Ma7oona. Maa7oni Beet-Xura yelis.<verse eid="1CH 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46"/>Kaaleba laggethiya Efa, Harana, Moodanne Gazeeza yelasu; Haraani Gazeeza geetetiya hara adde na7a yelis.<verse eid="1CH 2:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47"/>Yahidaya nayti Regema, Iyo7atama, Geshana, Falexa, Efanne Shafa.<verse eid="1CH 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48"/>Kaaleba laggethiya Ma7ika Sheberanne Tirihaana yelasu. <verse eid="1CH 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49"/>Qassika Medmaana aawa Shafanne Makibeenanne Gib7a aawa Susana yelasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:49">Kaaleba macca na7e sunthay Akiso.<verse eid="1CH 2:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50"/>Kaaleba nayti harati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidosona. Kaalebi ba bayra na7aa Huura ba mache Efraatape yelis. Huura nayti Qiriyat-Yi7aarima aawa Sobaala, <verse eid="1CH 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51"/>Beeteleme aawa Salmonanne Beet-Gadera aawa Hareefa. <verse eid="1CH 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52"/>Qiriyat-Yi7aarima aawa Sobaala yarati Haro7eetatanne Manuhoota yaratape baggata. <verse eid="1CH 2:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53"/>Qiriyat-Yi7aarima yarati Yatireta, Puuteta, Shumaatetanne Mishireta. Xor7atinne Eshta7ooleti haysatape yeletidosona. <verse eid="1CH 2:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54"/>Beeteleme aawa Salmoona yarati Naxoofata, Axiroot-Beeteyo7abeta, Manuhoota yaratape baggatanne Xor7ata. <verse eid="1CH 2:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55"/>Yaabexa kataman de7iya xaafeta yarati Tir7eta, Shim7atanne Sukata. Haysati Rekaabata aawa Hamaatape yeletida Qeenata.<verse eid="1CH 2:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1"/>Kebroona kataman Dawiti yelida nayti haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata; Izira7eele maccase Aknahoomipe yelida bayra na7ay Amnoona. Qarmeloosa maccase Abigiyape yelida nam7antho na7ay Daanela. <verse eid="1CH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2"/>Geshura kawa Talmaya na7iya Ma7ika yelida heedzantho na7ay Abeseloome. Agita yelida oyddantho na7ay Adoniyaasa. <verse eid="1CH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3"/>Abixaala yelida ichashantho na7ay Safaaxa. Egila yelida usupuntho na7ay Yitirhaama. <verse eid="1CH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4"/>Dawiti ha usupun nayta Kebroonan yelis. Dawiti Kebroonan laapun laythinne usupun ageena kawotis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:4">Yerusalaamen hastamanne heedzu laythi kawotis. <verse eid="1CH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5"/>Dawiti Yerusalaamen Ami7eela na7e Barsaabepe yelida oyddu nayti Saamusa, Sobaaba, Naatanenne Solomone. <verse eid="1CH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6"/>Qassi hara uddufun adde nayti Iyabhaara, Elishu7a, Elfalaxa, <verse eid="1CH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7"/>Noga, Nefeqa, Yafaya, <verse eid="1CH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8"/>Elsama, Eldahenne Elfalaxa. <verse eid="1CH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9"/>Ha adde nayta ubbaa bolla Dawitas laggethotape yeletida hara adde nayti de7oosona; Timaaro geetetiya micha entaw de7awusu.<verse eid="1CH 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda Kawota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10"/>Kawa Solomone yeletay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa. Solomone na7ay Orobi7aama; Orobi7aama na7ay Abiya; Abiya na7ay Asa; Asa na7ay Iyosaafexa; <verse eid="1CH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11"/>Iyosaafexa na7ay Iyoraama; Iyoraama na7ay Akaziyaasa; Akaziyaasa na7ay Iyo7aasa; <verse eid="1CH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12"/>Iyo7aasa na7ay Amasiyaasa; Amasiyaasa na7ay Azaariyasa; Azaariyasa na7ay Iyo7atama; <verse eid="1CH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13"/>Iyo7atama na7ay Akaaza; Akaaza na7ay Hizqiyaasa; Hizqiyaasa na7ay Minaase; <verse eid="1CH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14"/>Minaase na7ay Amoxe; Amoxe na7ay Iyosyaasa. <verse eid="1CH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15"/>Iyosyaasa na7ay bayray Yohaanana; nam7anthoy Iyo7aaqeme; heedzanthoy Sedeqiyaasa; oyddanthoy Salooma. <verse eid="1CH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16"/>Iyo7aaqeme nayti Ikoniyaananne Sedeqiyaasa.<verse eid="1CH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawota Yeleta Susa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17"/>Di7etidi Babiloone bida Ikoniyaana adde nayti Salatiyaala, <verse eid="1CH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18"/>Malkiraama, Padaya, Shenaxaara, Yiqaama, Hoshamanne Nadaaba. <verse eid="1CH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19"/>Padaya adde nayti Zarubaabelanne Same7a. Zarubaabela adde nayti Masulaamanne Hanaana; enta michiya Salomito. <verse eid="1CH 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20"/>Hayisata bolla hara ichashu adde nayti Zarubaabelas de7oosona; entika Hashuba, Oheela, Baraka, Hasadiyanne Yoshab-Heseda.<verse eid="1CH 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21"/>Hanaana adde nayti Palaxanne Yeshaya. Yeshaya na7ay Rafaya; Rafaya na7ay Arnaana; Arnaana na7ay Abdiyu; Abdiyu na7ay Sakana; <verse eid="1CH 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22"/>Sakana na7ay Shamaya. Shamaya nayti ichashati Haxusa, Yigi7aala, Bariha, Na7aranne Shaafaxa. <verse eid="1CH 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23"/>Na7ara nayti heedzati Eliyo7ana, Hizqiyaasanne Aziriqaama. <verse eid="1CH 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24"/>Eliyo7ana nayti laapunati Hodawa, Eliyaseeba, Palaya, Aquba, Yohaanana, Dalayanne Aneena.<verse eid="1CH 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Hara Yihuda Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1"/>Yihuda kochati Paaresa, Hesiroona, Karma, Hooranne Sobaala.<verse eid="1CH 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2"/>Sobaala na7ay Rayi Yahaata yelis; Yahaati Ahumayanne Lahada yelis. Haysati Xor7ata yarata. <verse eid="1CH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3"/>Exaama adde nayti Izira7eele, Yishmanne Yidibaasha; enta michiya Haxilelpoono. <verse eid="1CH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4"/>Panu7eeli Gadoora yelis. Exeri Husha yelis. Huuri ba aaye Efraatas bayra na7a; Huuri Beeteleme aawa. Haysati Huura yarata.<verse eid="1CH 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5"/>Tequhe aawa Ashihuuras Heelonne Na7ira geetetiya nam7u macheti de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6"/>Na7ira Ahuzama, Hefeera, Teminanne Ashitaara Ashihuuras yelasu; haysati Na7iri nayta. <verse eid="1CH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7"/>Heela adde nayti Dereta, Yixhaaranne Etnaana. <verse eid="1CH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8"/>Qooxe adde nayti Anuba, Xobebanne Aharheela.<verse eid="1CH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9"/>Yaabexi ba ishatape aadhidi bonchetida asi. Iya aayiya, “Taani iya iita iqethan yelida gisho, iya sunthay Yaabexa” gada xeegasu. <verse eid="1CH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10"/>Yaabexi Isra7eele Xoossaa xeegidi, “Abeeti Xoossaw, tana anja; ta zawa dalgisa. Ne kushey taara gido; tana azzanthonna mela qohiyabaape naaga” yaagidi woossin Xoossay iya woosa si7is.<verse eid="1CH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11"/>Shuha ishay Kaluba Mahira yelis; Mahiri Eshtoona yelis. <verse eid="1CH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12"/>Eshtooni Beet-Raafa, Pasehanne Irnahasha aawa Tahina yelis. Tahini Nahaasa katamaa asaa yelis. Haysati Reka biittan de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13"/>Qeneza adde nayti Gotoniyalanne Saraya; Gotoniyala adde nayti Hatatanne Ma7onotaya. <verse eid="1CH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14"/>Ma7onotayi Ofira yelis. Sarayi Iyo7aaba yelis. Iyo7aabi Kushe Hiillata Zangaara geetetiya bessan de7iya asaa yelis.<verse eid="1CH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15"/>Yoofone na7aa Kaaleba nayti Ira, Eelanne Na7aama. Ela na7ay Qeneza.<verse eid="1CH 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16"/>Yihali7eela nayti Ziifa, Zifaha, Tirayanne Asar7eela.<verse eid="1CH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17"/>Ezira adde nayti Yetera, Mereeda, Eferanne Yaalona. Mereedi Gibxe kawa na7iw Bitiya ekin iya Mayraamo, Shamayanne Yishiba yelasu. Yishibi Eshtamoo7a yelis. <verse eid="1CH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18"/>Yihuda biittafe ekida machiya Gadoora aawa Yereda, Sooko aawa Hebeeranne Zanoha aawa Yaqit7eela yelasu. <verse eid="1CH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19"/>Nahama miche, Hodiya mache nayti Gariman de7iya Qa7ila aawanne Ma7ikan de7iya Eshtamoo7a aawa.<verse eid="1CH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20"/>Shimoona nayti Amnoona, Irna, Benihananne Tiloona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:20">Yishi7a nayti Zoheetanne Benzoheeta.<verse eid="1CH 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21"/>Yihuda na7aa Seela kochati Leeka aawa Era, Mareesa aawa Le7adanne Beet-Ashibe7a kataman de7iya liino ma7o daddeyisata yarata. <verse eid="1CH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22"/>Harati qassi Yoqima, Iyo7aasa, Yashubileheema, Moo7abe haarida Sarafanne Kozeba kataman de7iya asata. Ha yeletaa mazgabey benipe doomidi de7ees. <verse eid="1CH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23"/>Haysati Naxa7imaninne Gadeeran de7iya meqa miishe medhiya asata. Enti kawa ooso oothanaw iyara issife de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Simoona Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24"/>Simoona nayti Nemu7eela, Yamina, Yariba, Zaaranne Saa7ula. <verse eid="1CH 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25"/>Saa7ula na7ay Saluma; Saluma na7ay Mibsaama; Mibsaama na7ay Masmaa7a; <verse eid="1CH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26"/>Masmaa7a na7ay Hamu7eela; Hamu7eela na7ay Zakura; Zakura na7ay Same7a. <verse eid="1CH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27"/>Same7i tammanne usupun adde naytanne usupun macca nayta yelis. Shin iya ishati daro na7a yelibookona. Yihuda kochaada Simoona kochay daribookona.<verse eid="1CH 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28"/>Simoona kochati Barsaabe katamaninne Molada, Haxar-Shu7aala, <verse eid="1CH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29"/>Baala, Exema, Tolada, <verse eid="1CH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30"/>Batu7eela, Horma, Xiqilaaga, <verse eid="1CH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31"/>Beet-Markaboota, Hoxar-Susima, Beet-Biranne Sha7aarima katamatan de7idosona. Dawiti kawotana gakanaw haysati katamata gididi de7idosona. <verse eid="1CH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32"/>Qassi enta gutati Exaama, Ayna, Irmoona, Tokenanne Ashshana. Enti kumethi ichashu katamata. <verse eid="1CH 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33"/>Ba7aale gakanaw ha katamata yuushuwan de7iya gutati ubbay entan gujetoosona. Haysati enti de7iya bessatanne banta yeletaa maara mazgaben xaafidi oykidosona.<verse eid="1CH 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34"/>Simoona yarata halaqati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. Enti Mashobaaba, Yamileka, Amasiyaasa na7aa Iyosiya, <verse eid="1CH 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35"/>Iyyu7eelanne Yoshiba na7aa Iyyu. Iyyu aawa aaway Asa7eela na7a Saraya. <verse eid="1CH 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36"/>Hara halaqati qassi Eliyo7ana, Yayqooba, Yashohaya, Asaya, Adi7eela, Yasmi7eela, Banayanne <verse eid="1CH 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37"/>Ziiza. Ziizi Shifa na7a; Shifi Aloona na7a; Alooni Yadaya na7a; Yadayi Shimira na7a; Shimiri Shamaya na7a. <verse eid="1CH 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38"/>Simoona yarata halaqati haysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:38">Enta aawata kochay darishe bis. <verse eid="1CH 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39"/>Enti banta mehiyas heemmiya bessi koyishe Gadoora geliya bessaa matan de7iya zangaarape doloha baggara de7iya bessaa gakanaw bidosona. <verse eid="1CH 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40"/>Yan araddanne lo77o heemmiya bessi demmidosona; he biittay wopatethinne saroy kumida dalga biitta. Beni wode he biittan de7idaysati Kaama kochaa. <verse eid="1CH 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41"/>Haysafe qommon sunthay xaafetida Simoona kochati Yihuda kawa Hizqiyaasa wode Gadoora biitta bidi yan de7iya Kaama kochaanne Ma7uuna asata olidi dhaysidosona. He biittan enta mehiyas heemmiya bessi de7iya gisho, Simoona kochati hachi gakanaw yan uttidosona.<verse eid="1CH 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42"/>Simoona kochaafe ichashu xeetu asay Sayre zuma bidosona. Enta halaqati Yishi7a nayta Palaxa, Naara, Rafayanne Uzi7eela. <verse eid="1CH 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43"/>Baqatidi attida Amaaleqa asaa dhaysidi enti hachi gakanaw he biittan de7oosona.<verse eid="1CH 4:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Robeela Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1"/>Isra7eele bayra na7aa Robeela yeletay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa. Robeeli bayra na7a; shin ba aawa hiixa tunisida gisho, bayratetha maatay Isra7eele na7aa Yoosefa naytas imetis. Hessa gisho, iya yeletay bayratetha maara naagidi xaafetibeenna. <verse eid="1CH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2"/>Yihudi ba ishatape aadhidi mino; bayratethay Yoosefas imetidaba gidikoka, Isra7eele asaa haareysi Yihudape keyis. <verse eid="1CH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3"/>Isra7eele bayra na7aa Robeela adde nayti Henooha, Pala, Hesiroonanne Karma.<verse eid="1CH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4"/>Iyyu7eela na7ay Shamaya; Shamaya na7ay Googa; Googa na7ay Same7a; <verse eid="1CH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5"/>Sama7a na7ay Mika; Mika na7ay Raya; Raya na7ay Bi7eela. <verse eid="1CH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6"/>Bi7eela na7ay Asoore kawoy Telgeltelfelisoorii di77idi efida Bi7eera; Bi7eeri Robeela kochata halaqa. <verse eid="1CH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7"/>Bi7eera dabboti, banta yeleta mazgaben xaafida Robeela yarata halaqati Iyyu7eelanne, Zakaryaasa. <verse eid="1CH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8"/>Bi7eeli Azaaza na7a; Azaazi Shama7a na7a; Shama7i Iyyu7eela koche. Iyyu7eela kochati Aro7eera kataman, Nebo biittaninne Ba7aal-Ma7oona biittan de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9"/>Robeela kochatas mehey Galadan darida gisho, enti yaape doloha bagga bidi, Efraxiisa shaafa gakanaw de7iya mela biittan uttidosona. <verse eid="1CH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10"/>Saa7ola laythan Aggaara yaratara Robeela yarati oletidi xoonidosona. Galadape doloha baggara de7iya Aggaara yarata biittan uttidosona.<verse eid="1CH 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaade Sheesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11"/>Gaade kochati Robeela kochatape pudeha baggan, Salka gakanaw de7iya Baasane biittan uttidosona. <verse eid="1CH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12"/>Iyyu7eeli koyro yaratas halaqa; Safaami nam7antho yaratas halaqa. Yanaynne Safaami Baasanen uttida yaratas halaqa. <verse eid="1CH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13"/>Enta dabboti, banta soo asan asan, Mika7eela, Masulaama, Saaba, Yoraya, Yaqkana, Zu7enne Ebeera. Enti kumethi laapuna. <verse eid="1CH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14"/>Haysati Abikaala nayti Buza kochata. Buzi Yedaya yelis; Yedayey Iyesaya yelis; Iyesayi Mika7eela yelis; Mika7eeli Galada yelis; Galadi Idaya yelis; Idayi Huura yelis; Huuri Abihaala yelis. <verse eid="1CH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15"/>Enta soo asaa halaqay Guna na7aa na7aa Abdi7eela na7aa Aka. <verse eid="1CH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16"/>Enti Galadaninne Baasanen, yan de7iya katamataninne Saarona biittan mehey heemetiya bessatan uttidosona. <verse eid="1CH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17"/>Hayisata yeletay Yihuda kawa Iyo7atama wode Isra7eele kawa Iyorbaama wode mazgaben xaafetis.<verse eid="1CH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18"/>Robeela kochaafe, Gaade kochaafenne Minaase kochaa baggaafe gondalle oykeysati, mashshe danceysatinne donge dukeysati minonne olan loohidaysati 44, 760. <verse eid="1CH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19"/>Enti Aggaara yaraara, Ixura yaraara, Nafesaranne Nodabaara oletidosona. <verse eid="1CH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20"/>Enti he asaara oletishe Xoossako waassida gisho, maado demmidosona. Enti Xoossan ammanetida gisho, I entaw woosetis. Hessa gisho, Aggaara yaratinne entara de7iya harati enta kushen gelidosona. <verse eid="1CH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21"/>Banta morketape ishatamu mukulu gimaleta, nam7u xeetanne ishatamu mukulu dorsata, nam7u mukulu haretanne xeetu mukulu asaa di77idi efidosona. <verse eid="1CH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22"/>Olay Xoossaba gidida gisho daroti hayqidosona. Di7etetha wodey gakanaw he biittan de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minaase Kochaafe Bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23"/>Minaase kochaafe bagga yaray Baasanepe doomidi, Ba7aal-Armoona, Saniranne Armoona zumaa gakanaw de7iya biittan uttidosona; enti he biittan daridosona. <verse eid="1CH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24"/>Enta soo halaqati Efera, Yish7a, Eli7eela, Azri7eela, Ermiyaasa, Hodawanne Iyodi7eela. Haysati enta soo asan eretidaysata, xaalanne wolqaama.<verse eid="1CH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25"/>Shin banta mayzata Xoossaas ammanetibokona; Xoossay enta sinthafe dhaysida he biitta xoossata goyinnidosona. <verse eid="1CH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26"/>Hessa gisho, Isra7eele Xoossay Asoore kawa Pooha (hessika Telgeltelfelisoora) ayyaana denthethidi Robeela kochaa, Gaade kochaanne Minaase kochaafe baggaa di77idi, Halaha, Habooranne Haara biittanne Gozaana Shaafa efis. Enti hachi gakanaw yan de7oosona.<verse eid="1CH 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Leewe Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1"/>Leewe adde nayti Gedisoona, Qahaatanne Maraara.<verse eid="1CH 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2"/>Qahaata adde nayti Amraama, Yisihaara, Kebroonanne Uzi7eela.<verse eid="1CH 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3"/>Amraama adde nayti Aarona, Musenne Mayraamo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:3">Aarona adde nayti Nadaaba, Abyooda, Alaazaranne Itamaara.<verse eid="1CH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4"/>Alaazari Pinihaasa yelis; Pinihaasi Abisu yelis; Abisuy Buuqa yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5"/>Buuqi Oza yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6"/>Ozi Zara yelis; Zarahi Marayoota yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7"/>Marayooti Amaare yelis; Amaarey Akxooba yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8"/>Akxoobi Saadoqa yelis; Saadoqi Akmaasa yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9"/>Akimaasi Azaariyasa yelis; Azaariyasi Yohaana yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10"/>Yohaani Azaariyasa yelis. Solomoney Yerusalaamen keexisida Xoossa keethan oothida kahiney Azaariyasa. <verse eid="1CH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11"/>Azaariyasi Amaare yelis; Amaarey Akxooba yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12"/>Akxoobi Saadoqa yelis; Saadoqi Saluma yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13"/>Salumi Kalqe yelis; Kalqey Azaariyasa yelis; <verse eid="1CH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14"/>Azaariyasi Saraya yelis; Sarayi Iyosadeqa yelis. <verse eid="1CH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15"/>Goday Yihudanne Yerusalaame Nabukadanaxooran di7etana mela oothida wode Iyosadeqi di7etidi bis.<verse eid="1CH 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16"/>Leewe adde nayti Gedisoona, Qahaatanne Maraara. <verse eid="1CH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17"/>Gedisoona adde nayta sunthay Libinanne Same7a. <verse eid="1CH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18"/>Qahaata adde nayti Amraama, Yisihaara, Kebroonanne Uzi7eela. <verse eid="1CH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19"/>Maraara adde nayti Mahilanne Muse. Banta soo asan asan xaafetida Leewe yaray haysa.<verse eid="1CH 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20"/>Gedisoona na7ay Libina; Libina na7ay Yahaata; Yahaata na7ay Zamata. <verse eid="1CH 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21"/>Zamata na7ay Yo7aaka; Yo7aaka na7ay Ado; Ado na7ay Zaara; Zaara na7ay Yatira.<verse eid="1CH 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22"/>Qahaata na7ay Amnadaabe; Amnadaabe na7ay Qore; Qore na7ay Aseera; <verse eid="1CH 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23"/>Aseera na7ay Helqaana; Helqaana na7ay Abisaafa; Abisaafa na7ay Aseera; <verse eid="1CH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24"/>Aseera na7ay Tahata; Tahata na7ay Uri7eela; Uri7eela na7ay Ooziyana; Ooziyana na7ay Saa7ola.<verse eid="1CH 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25"/>Helqaana adde nayti Amaasanne Akmoota. <verse eid="1CH 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26"/>Akmoota na7ay Helqaana; Helqaana na7ay Xofaya; Xofaya na7ay Nahaata; <verse eid="1CH 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27"/>Nahaata na7ay Eliyaaba; Eliyaaba na7ay Yirohaama; Yirohaama na7ay Hilqaana.<verse eid="1CH 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28"/>Sameela bayra na7ay Iyyu7eela; kaaloy Abiya.<verse eid="1CH 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29"/>Maraara adde nayti Mahila; Mahila na7ay Libina; Libina na7ay Same7a; Same7a na7ay Ooza; <verse eid="1CH 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30"/>Ooza na7ay Sam77a; Sam77a na7ay Hagiya; Hagiya na7ay Asaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keetha Zammaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31"/>Dawiti Taabotiya Yerusalaame ehidaape guye, Godaa keethan shuumida zammaareta halaqati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. <verse eid="1CH 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32"/>Solomoney Yerusalaamen Godaa Xoossaa keetha keexana gakanaw, Godaa Taabotey de7iya Dunkaaniya sinthan issoy issoy ba maaran maaran mazmure yexishe Godaas oothidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33"/>Banta adde naytara yexidaysati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:33">Qahaata yaraape zammariya Hemaana; Hemaani Iyyu7eela na7a; Iyyu7eela Sameela na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34"/>Sameeli Helqaana na7aa; Hilqaani Yirohaama na7a; Yirohaami Eli7eela na7a; Eli7eeli Toha na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35"/>Tohi Xofaya na7a; Xofaya Helqaana na7a; Hilqaani Mahaata na7a; Mahaati Amasaya na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36"/>Amasayi Helqaana na7a; Helqaani Iyyu7eela na7a; Iyyu7eela Azaariyasa na7a; Azaariyasi Sofoniyaasa na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37"/>Sofoniyaasi Tahata na7a; Tahati Aseera na7a; Aseeri Abisaafa na7a; Abisaafi Qore na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38"/>Qorey Yisara na7a; Yisari Qahaata na7a; Qahaati Leewe na7a; Leewey Isra7eele na7a.<verse eid="1CH 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39"/>Hemaana dabboy Asaafi iya ushacha baggara eqidi oothees. Asaafi Baraka na7a; Baraka Sim7a na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40"/>Shim7i Mika7eela na7a; Mika7eeli Ba7asaya na7a; Ba7aasi Malkiya na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41"/>Malkey Etaana na7a; Etaani Zaara na7a; Zaari Adaya na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42"/>Adayi Etaana na7a; Etaani Zamata na7a; Zamati Same7a na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43"/>Same7i Yahaata na7a; Yahaati Gedisoona na7a; Gedisooni Leewe na7a.<verse eid="1CH 6:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44"/>Entafe haddirsa baggara enta dabboti, Maraara yarati eqoosona. Etaani Qiisa na7a; Qiisi Abdi na7a; Abdi Maluka na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45"/>Maluki Hashabaya na7a; Hashabaya Amasiyaasa na7a; Amasiyaasi Kalqe na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46"/>Kilqey Ameesa na7a; Ameesi Baana na7a; Baani Samara na7a; <verse eid="1CH 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47"/>Samari Mahila na7a; Mahili Muse na7a; Musi Maraara na7a; Maraari Leewe na7a. <verse eid="1CH 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48"/>Enta dabo gidida Leeweti Xoossa Dunkaaniyan oothanaw sunthetidosona.<verse eid="1CH 6:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aarona Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49"/>Shin Aaroninne iya kochati ixaane cuyisoosona; yarsho bessan xuussa yarsho yarshoosona. Xoossa aylley Musey kiitidaysada Ubbaafe Geeshsha Bessan goyinniya goyinno ubbaasinne Xoossay Isra7eele nagaraa atto yaagisiya yarshuwa yarshanaw aawatethi entaw de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 6:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50"/>Aarona yeletay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. Aarona na7ay Alaazara; Alaazara na7ay Pinihaasa; Pinihaasa na7ay Abisu; <verse eid="1CH 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51"/>Abisu na7ay Buuqa; Buuqa na7ay Oza; Oza na7ay Zaraha. <verse eid="1CH 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52"/>Zaraha na7ay Marayoota; Marayoota na7ay Amaare; Amaare na7ay Akxuuba; <verse eid="1CH 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53"/>Akxuuba na7ay Saadoqa; Saadoqa na7ay Akmaasa.<verse eid="1CH 6:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54"/>Aarona kochati daana mela entaw imetida bessati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:54">Koyro saamay Qahaata yaraas keyida gisho <verse eid="1CH 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55"/>Yihudan de7iya Kebroona katamaanne iya yuushuwan de7iya hentha bessata entaw immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56"/>Shin Kebroona goshsha gadetanne iya yuushuwan de7iya gutata Yoofone na7aa Kaalebas immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57"/>Aarona naytas baqatidi attiya katamata, Kebroona, Yatira, Libina, Eshtamoo7anne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata. <verse eid="1CH 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58"/>Holona, Dabiranne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata, <verse eid="1CH 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59"/>Asana, Beet-Sameesanne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60"/>Qassi Biniyaame biitta zawape Gib7a, Galemata, Anatootenne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata entaw immidosona. Aarona naytas imetida katamati kumethi tammanne heedza. <verse eid="1CH 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61"/>Minaase yaraa baggaa biittafe tammu katamata attida Qahaata yaraas immidosona.<verse eid="1CH 6:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62"/>Yisakoora, Aseera, Niftaalemenne Baasanen de7iya Minaase yaraa biitta zawape tammanne heedzu katamata Gedisoona yaraas immidosona.<verse eid="1CH 6:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63"/>Robeela, Gaadenne Zabloona biitta zawape tammanne nam7u katamata Maraara yaraas immidosona.<verse eid="1CH 6:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64"/>Hessada oothidi, Isra7eele asay Leewetas ha katamatanne enta heeran de7iya hentha biitta immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65"/>Yihudape, Simoonapenne Biniyaame biitta zawape haysafe qommon xaafetida katamata entaw immidosona.<verse eid="1CH 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66"/>Qahaata yaraape guuthati Efreema biitta zawape katamatanne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata ekidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67"/>Entaw asay baqatidi attiya katamata, derey dariya Efreema biittan de7iya Seekema, Gezera, <verse eid="1CH 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68"/>Yoqim7aama, Beet-Horona, <verse eid="1CH 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69"/>Eloona, Gaat-Rimoonanne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70"/>Minaase kocha baggaafe Aneera, Bil7aamanne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata, attida Qahaata yaraas immidosona.<verse eid="1CH 6:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71"/>Minaase kocha baggaafe Baasanen de7iya Goolana, Astarootanne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata Gedisoona yaraas immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72"/>Yisakoora kochaafe Qaadesa, Dabiraatenne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata, <verse eid="1CH 6:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:73"/>Raamota, Anemananne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74"/>Aseera kochaafe Mashala, Abdoona, <verse eid="1CH 6:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:75"/>Huqooqa, Rehoobanne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76"/>Niftaaleme kochaafe Galilan de7iya Qaadesa, Hamoona, Qirataymanne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata immidosona.<verse eid="1CH 6:76"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77"/>Attida Maraara yaraas Zabloona kochaafe Irmoona, Taaborenne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:77"/><verse number="78" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78"/>Robeela kochaafe Iyaarkofe hefinthan Yordaanosepe doloha baggara, dhoqa denban de7iya Boosora, Yaasane, <verse eid="1CH 6:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:79"/>Qidimoota, Mefaatanne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 6:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80"/>Gaade kochaafe Galadan de7iya Raamota, Mahanayma, <verse eid="1CH 6:80"/><verse number="81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:81"/>Haseboona, Iyazeeranne enta heeran de7iya hentha bessata immidosona.<verse eid="1CH 6:81"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yisakoora Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1"/>Yisakoora oyddu adde nayti Tola, Puuwa, Yasuubanne Shimiroona.<verse eid="1CH 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2"/>Tola adde nayti Oza, Rafaya, Yir7eela, Himaya, Yibsaamanne Shimu7eela; haysati Tola soo asaa halaqata. Enti wolqaamanne mino asi. Dawita wode enta tayboy 22,600.<verse eid="1CH 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3"/>Oza na7ay Yizraaha. Yizraaha nayti Mika7eela, Abdiyu, Iyyu7eelanne Yishiya; ha ichashati soo asaa halaqata. <verse eid="1CH 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4"/>Banta soo asaa yeletada Oza yaraape olanchoti 36,000; entaw daro machetinne nayti de7oosona.<verse eid="1CH 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5"/>Yisakoora kochaafe olanchoti banta yeletaa mazgaben taybetidi, kumethi 87,000 gididosona.<verse eid="1CH 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biniyaame Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6"/>Biniyaame heedzu adde nayti Beella, Bekeranne Yidi7eela.<verse eid="1CH 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7"/>Beella adde nayti Eseboona, Oza, Uzi7eela, Iyarmootanne Ira; ha ichashati soo asaa halaqata. Enti wolqaamanne mino asi. Banta yeletada taybetida olanchoti 22,034 gididosona.<verse eid="1CH 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8"/>Bekera adde nayti Zamira, Iyo7aasa, Alaazara, Eliyo7ana, Omira, Iyarmoota, Abiya, Anatootanne Alemeeta. <verse eid="1CH 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9"/>Banta yeletaa mazgaben taybetida wolqaamanne mino asati 20,200 gididosona.<verse eid="1CH 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10"/>Yidi7eela na7ay Bilihaana. Bilihaana adde nayti Yi7uusa, Biniyaame, Ehuuda, Kin7ana, Zetana, Tarsesanne Aksaara; <verse eid="1CH 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11"/>haysati banta soo asaa halaqa; wolqaamanne mino asi. Banta yeletada taybetida olanchoti 17,200. <verse eid="1CH 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12"/>Sufiminne Hufimi Ira nayta. Hushimi Ahere na7a.<verse eid="1CH 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Niftaaleme Sheesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13"/>Niftaaleme nayti Yahixi7eela, Guna, Yexeranne Shilema; haysati Baala kochata.<verse eid="1CH 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minaase Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14"/>Minaase kochati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. Minaase Soore laggethefe yelida adde nayti Asiri7eelanne Galada aawa Makira. <verse eid="1CH 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15"/>Makiri Hufimapenne Safimape issi issi macho ekis. Makira miche sunthay Ma7iko. Makira na7ay kaaloy Selophaada; Selophaadi macca na7a xalaala yelis.<verse eid="1CH 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16"/>Makira machiya Ma7ika Pareesanne Suroosa geetetiya nam7u adde nayta yelasu. Paaresa nayti Ulamanne Raqeema. <verse eid="1CH 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17"/>Ulama na7ay Badaana. Haysati Minaase na7aa na7a Makira na7aa Galada kochata.<verse eid="1CH 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18"/>Galada michiya Hamoleketa, Isude, Abi7ezeranne Mahila yelasu.<verse eid="1CH 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19"/>Shamida adde nayti Ahiya, Seekema, Liqanne Ani7aama.<verse eid="1CH 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efreema Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20"/>Efreema na7ay Shutula; Shutula na7ay Bareda; Bareda na7ay Tahata; Tahata na7ay Elada; Elada na7ay Tahata; <verse eid="1CH 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21"/>Tahata na7ay Zabada; Zabada na7ay Shutula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 7:21">Efreemas Ederanne Elada geetetiya hara nam7u nayti de7oosona. Enti Geete asaa mehe kaysin asay enta wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22"/>Hessa gisho, enta aaway Efreemi daro wode azzanin iya ishati iya minthethanaw yidosona.<verse eid="1CH 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23"/>Hessafe guye, I ba machera aqis; iya qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. Efreema soo gakida iita metuwa gisho I ba na7aa Bari7a gidi sunthis.<verse eid="1CH 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24"/>She7ira geetetiya Efreema na7iya de7awusu; Garsan Beet-Horona, Qommon Uzen-Sheera geetetiya katamata keexasu.<verse eid="1CH 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25"/>Efreema adde na7ay Raafa; Raafa na7ay Resheefa; Resheefa na7ay Teela; Teela na7ay Tahana; <verse eid="1CH 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26"/>Tahana na7ay Laadana; Laadana na7ay Amhuda; Amhuda na7ay Elsama; <verse eid="1CH 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27"/>Elsama na7ay Nawe; Nawe na7ay Iyyasu.<verse eid="1CH 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28"/>Efreema kochati ekidi bantaw daana bessi oothida biittay, Beetelenne iya yuushuwan de7iya gutata; doloha baggan Na7ara, wuloha baggan Gezeranne enta yuushuwan de7iya gutata, Seekema, Ayanne enta yuushuwan de7ya gutata ubbaa oykees. <verse eid="1CH 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29"/>Minaase biitta zawan de7iya Beet-Saananne iya yuushuwan de7iya gutata, Tanakanne iya yuushuwan de7iya gutata, Magidonne iya yuushuwan de7iya gutata, Dooranne iya yuushuwan de7iya gutata. Isra7eele na7aa Yoosefa kochati ha katamatan de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aseera Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30"/>Aseera adde nayti Yimina, Yesuwa, Yisiwanne Beri7a; enta michiya Saraho.<verse eid="1CH 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31"/>Beri7a adde nayti Hebeeranne Berzaaweta aawa Malka7eela.<verse eid="1CH 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32"/>Hebeeri Yaafilexa, Sameera, Hotama yelis; enta miche sunthay Soosano.<verse eid="1CH 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33"/>Yaafilexa adde nayti Pasaka, Bimihaalanne Asita.<verse eid="1CH 7:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34"/>Sameera adde nayti Aka, Rooga, Yahuubanne Araame.<verse eid="1CH 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35"/>Hotama adde nayti Xoofa, Yimina, Selesanne Amala.<verse eid="1CH 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36"/>Xoofa adde nayti Suha, Harnefera, Sogala, Beera, Yimira, <verse eid="1CH 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37"/>Bexera, Hoda, Saama, Selisa, Yitiraananne Bi7eera.<verse eid="1CH 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38"/>Yetera adde nayti Yorona, Pispanne Ara. <verse eid="1CH 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39"/>Ula adde nayti Era, Han7eelanne Irxa.<verse eid="1CH 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40"/>Haysati ubbati Aseera kochata. Enti banta soo asaa halaqatanne dooretida wolqaamanne mino asi. Banta yeletada taybetida olanchoti 26,000 gididosona.<verse eid="1CH 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Biniyaame Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1"/>Biniyaame bayra na7ay Beella; kaaloy Asbeela; heedzanthoy Ahira; <verse eid="1CH 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2"/>oyddanthoy Nohe; ichashanthoy Raafa.<verse eid="1CH 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3"/>Beella adde nayti Adaare, Geera, Abhuuda, <verse eid="1CH 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4"/>Abisu Na7imaane, Ahoha, <verse eid="1CH 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5"/>Geera, Safufaamanne Kiraama.<verse eid="1CH 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6-7"/>Ehuuda adde nayti Na7imaane, Akiyanne Geera. Enti Gib7an de7idanne guyepe Manahaata biitta di7etidi bida banta soo asaa halaqata. Enta yaa kaalethidi efiday Ozanne Ahuda aawa Geera.<verse eid="1CH 8:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8"/>Shaharaami ba macheta Hushimonne Ba7iira yeddidaape guye Moo7abe biittan adde nayta yelis. <verse eid="1CH 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9"/>Shaharaami ba mache Hodishipe Yobaaba, Dibaya, Meesa, Malkaama, <verse eid="1CH 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10"/>Ye7uxa, Sakiyaanne Mirma yelis. Iya nayti ubbay banta soo asaa halaqata gididosona. <verse eid="1CH 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11"/>I ba mache Hushimipe, Abixubanne Elfa7aala yelis.<verse eid="1CH 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12"/>Elfa7aala adde nayti Ebeera, Mashemanne Shameda. Shamedi Ononne Looda katamatanne enta heeran de7iya gutata keexis.<verse eid="1CH 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13"/>Shaharaami Beri7anne Shem77a yelis. Enti Eloona kataman de7iya banta soo asaa halaqata. Enti Geete kataman de7iya asaa gooddidosona. <verse eid="1CH 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14"/>Beri7a adde nayti Shaharaama, Ahiya, Shashaqa, Yiremoota.<verse eid="1CH 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15"/>Zabada, Arada, Edera, <verse eid="1CH 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16"/>Mika7eela, Yishphanne Yooha.<verse eid="1CH 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17"/>Elfala7a adde nayti Zabada, Masulaama, Hizqa, Hebeera, <verse eid="1CH 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18"/>Yishmaraya, Yuzilanne Yobaaba.<verse eid="1CH 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19"/>Same7a adde nayti Yaqma, Zikira, Zibada <verse eid="1CH 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20"/>Elanaya, Xiltaya, Elela, <verse eid="1CH 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21"/>Adaya, Birayanne Shimirata.<verse eid="1CH 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22"/>Shashaqa adde nayti Yishphana, Ebeera, Eli7eela, <verse eid="1CH 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23"/>Abdoona, Zikira, Hanaana, <verse eid="1CH 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24"/>Hanaaniya, Elama, Antota, <verse eid="1CH 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25"/>Yifdayanne Panu7eela.<verse eid="1CH 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26"/>Yirohaama adde nayti Shemshiraya, Shehaara, Ataala, <verse eid="1CH 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27"/>Yaaresha, Eelyiaasanne Zikira.<verse eid="1CH 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28"/>Haysati banta yeletan Yerusalaamen uttida banta soo asaa halaqata.<verse eid="1CH 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29"/>Gaba7oona aaway Yi7eeli Gaba7oona kataman de7is; iya mache sunthay Ma7iko. <verse eid="1CH 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30"/>Iya na7aa bayray Abdoona; hara iya adde nayti Xuraya, Qiisa, Ba7aala, Neeranne Nadaaba, <verse eid="1CH 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31"/>Gedoora, Ahiya, Zekeranne <verse eid="1CH 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32"/>Maqloota. Maqlooti Shim7a yelis. Haysati Yerusalaamen de7iya banta dabbota matan de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33"/>Neeri Qiisa yelis; Qiisi Saa7ola yelis. Saa7oli Yoonataana, Malkisa, Abinadaabenne Asba7eela yelis. <verse eid="1CH 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34"/>Yoonataana na7ay Marba7aala yelis; Marba7aali Mikiyaasa yelis.<verse eid="1CH 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35"/>Mikiyaasa adde nayti Pitoona, Meleka, Tare7anne Akaaza. <verse eid="1CH 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36"/>Akaazi Yaho7ada yelis. Yaho7aadi Alemeeta, Azmaawetanne Zimira yelis. Zimiri Mooxa yelis; <verse eid="1CH 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37"/>Mooxi Bin7a yelis; Bin77i Raafa yelis; Raafi El7aasa yelis; El7aasi Axeela yelis.<verse eid="1CH 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38"/>Axeelas usupun adde nayti de7oosona. Enta sunthay Azirqaama, Bokeera, Isma7eela, Sha7aara, Abdiyunne Hanaana.<verse eid="1CH 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39"/>Axeela ishaa Esheqas heedzu nayti de7oosona. Iya na7ay bayray Ulama; kaaloy Yi7uusa; heedzanthoy Elfalaxa.<verse eid="1CH 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40"/>Ulama nayti wolqaamanne mino asi; enti dongen dukeyisata. Ulamas xeetanne ishatamu gidiya naytinne nayta nayti de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 8:40">Haysati ubbay Biniyaame kochata.<verse eid="1CH 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaamen De7iya Asaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1"/>Isra7eele asa ubbay ba yeletan yeletan, Isra7eele kawota maxaafan xaafetidi de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:1">Yihuda asay Godaas ammanetibona gisho Babiloone biitta di7etidi bidosona. <verse eid="1CH 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2"/>Koyro simmidi banta biittaninne banta katamatan uttiday guutha Isra7eele asata, kahineta, Leewetanne Xoossa keetha oosanchota. <verse eid="1CH 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3"/>Yihudape, Biniyaamepe, Efreemapenne Minaasepe guutha asati yidi Yerusalaamen de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4"/>Yihuda na7aa Paaresa yaraape Utayi Yerusalaamen de7eysatas halaqa. Utayi Amhuda na7a; Amhudi Omira na7a; Omiri Imira na7a; Imiri Baana na7a.<verse eid="1CH 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5"/>Yihuda na7aa Seela yaraape Asayinne iya nayti Yerusalaamen de7eysatas halaqa.<verse eid="1CH 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6"/>Yihuda na7aa Zaara yaraape Yi7u7eeli Yerusalaamen de7eysatas halaqa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:6">Yihuda kochaa tayboy usupun xeetanne uddufun tamma.<verse eid="1CH 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7"/>Biniyaame yaraa halaqati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:7">Masulaama na7aa Saalu, Hodawa na7aa Masulaama, Hasenaa7u na7aa Hodawa, <verse eid="1CH 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8"/>Yirohaama na7aa Yibinaya, Oza na7aa Ela, Mikira na7aa Oza, Safaaxa Masulaama, Ra7uula na7aa Safaaxa, Yibina na7aa Ragu7eela. <verse eid="1CH 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9"/>Biniyaame kochaa tayboy uddufun xeetanne ishatammanne usupuna. Haysati ubbay banta soo asaa halaqata.<verse eid="1CH 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10"/>Yerusalaamen de7ida kahineti haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:10">Enti Yodaha, Yoraba, Yakinanne <verse eid="1CH 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11"/>Xoossa keethan aawatiya Azaariyasa. Azaariyasi Kalqe na7a; Kalqey Masulaama na7a; Masulaami Saadoqa na7a; Saadoqi Mariyoota na7a; Mariyooti Akxooba na7a.<verse eid="1CH 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12"/>Harati qassi Yirohaama na7aa Adayanne Adi7eela na7aa Ma7iseya. Yirohaami Paskora na7a; Paskori Malkiya na7a. Adi7eeli Yahizeera na7a; Yahizeeri Masulaama na7a; Masulaami Mashilmoota na7a; Mashilmooti Imera na7a.<verse eid="1CH 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13"/>Banta soo asaas halaqa gidida kahineta tayboy 1,760. Haysati Xoossa keethan oothanaw danda7iya asata.<verse eid="1CH 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14"/>Yerusalaamen de7iya Leeweti haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:14">Hashuba na7ay Shamayey Maraara yara. Hashubi Aziriqaama na7a; Aziriqaami Hasabaya na7a.<verse eid="1CH 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15"/>Harati qassi Baqbaqara, Hereesa, Galaalanne Mataana. Mataani Mika na7a; Miki Zikira na7a; Zikiri Asaafa na7a.<verse eid="1CH 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16"/>Harati qassi Naxoofata gutan uttiday Abdiyunne Baraka. Abdiyuy Shama7iya na7a; Shama7ey Galaala na7a; Galaali Yedutuuna na7a; Baraki Asa na7a; Asi Elqaana na7a.<verse eid="1CH 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17"/>Kawo pengiya naageysati, Saluma, Aquba, Talmoona, Ahimaananne enta ishata; salumi enta halaqa. <verse eid="1CH 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18"/>Enti wuloha baggara de7iya, Kawo Pengiya naagidosona. Haysafe kase enti Leeweti dunkaanida gutaa naagoosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19"/>Abisaafa na7aa na7ay Qore na7ay Salumi Qore yara. Qore yaray kase Godaa Dunkaaniya naagidaysada Saluminne Qore koche gidida iya dabboti Xoossa keetha pengiya naagoosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20"/>Alaazara na7ay Pinihaasi kase Qore yaraa halaqa; Goday iyara de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21"/>Masulaama na7ay Zakariyasi Dunkaaniya giddo geliya pengiya naagees.<verse eid="1CH 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22"/>Pengiya naaganaw dooretidaysati kumethi nam7u xeetanne tammanne nam7a; hessati banta gutan gutan taybetidi xaafetidosona. Enta yaras ha aawatetha immiday kawa Dawitanne nabiya Sameela. <verse eid="1CH 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23"/>Hessa gisho, entinne enta nayti Xoossa keetha pengiya naagoosona. <verse eid="1CH 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24"/>Oyddu baggara dolohan, wulohan, pudehan dugehan issi issi pengey de7ees; he pengeta naageysati de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25"/>He gutan de7iya enta dabboti laapuntha gallasan gallasan laametidi, naagidi enta maaddoosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26"/>Pengiya naagiya oyddu Leeweti halaqa; enti Xoossa keethaa kifiletanne kifileta giddon de7iya miisheta aawatethan aysoosona. <verse eid="1CH 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27"/>Xoossa keethaa naageynne wonta guura kariya dooyey enta gidiya gisho yan aqoosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28"/>Leewetape guuthati goyinno wode go7etiya miisheta naagoosona; he miisheta kare kesseynne soo gelsey enta. <verse eid="1CH 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29"/>Entafe issoti issoti Xoossa keethan go7etiya hara miisheta, dhiille, woyne ushshu, zayte, ixaanenne sawota aawatethan aysoosona. <verse eid="1CH 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30"/>Shin kahineta naytape baggati sawuwa walakoosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31"/>Qore kochaafe Saluma bayra na7ay Mataatas yarsho uytha uukisiya aawatethi de7ees. <verse eid="1CH 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32"/>Qahaata yara gidiya enta dabbotape baggati Sambaatan Sambaatan xarpheeza bolla wothiya uythaa giigisiya aawatethi ekidosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33"/>Leewe kochaafe guutha halaqati Xoossa keethan yexeyisata. Qammanne gallas enti oothiya gisho hara ooso oothonna Xoossa keetha dirsa giddon de7iya keethatan de7oosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34"/>Haysati ubbay Leewe soo asaa halaqata; enti Yerusalaamen de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawa Saa7ola Sheeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35"/>Gaba7oona aaway Yi7eeli Gaba7oona kataman de7is; iya mache sunthay Ma7iko. <verse eid="1CH 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36"/>Iya na7ay bayray Abdoona; iya nayti harati Xuraya, Qiisa, Ba7aala, Neera, Nadaaba, <verse eid="1CH 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37"/>Gadoora, Ahiya, Zakariyasanne Mikloota. <verse eid="1CH 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38"/>Miklooti Sim7a yelis. Haysati Yerusalaamen de7iya banta dabbota matan de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39"/>Neeri Qiisa yelis; Qiisi Saa7ola yelis. Saa7oli Yoonataana, Malkisa, Abinadaabenne Eshba7aala yelis. <verse eid="1CH 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40"/>Yoonataana na7ay Marba7aala yelis; Marba7aali Mikiyaasa yelis.<verse eid="1CH 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41"/>Mikiyaasa nayti Pitoona, Meleka, Tare7anne Akaaza. <verse eid="1CH 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42"/>Akaazi Ya7ira yelis. Ya7iri Alemeeta, Azmaawetanne Zimira yelis. Zimiri Mooxa yelis; <verse eid="1CH 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43"/>Mooxi Bin7a yelis; Bin7i Rafaya yelis; Rafayi El7aasa yelis; El7aasi Axeela yelis.<verse eid="1CH 9:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44"/>Axeelas usupun adde nayti de7oosona. Enta sunthay Azirqaama, Bokeera, Isma7eela, Sha7aara, Abdiyunne Hanaana.<verse eid="1CH 9:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Kawa Saa7ola Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1 Same 31:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1"/>Filisxeemeti Isra7eele asaara oletidosona. Isra7eeleti Filisxeemeta sinthafe baqatidosona. He wode daro Isra7eele asay Gilbo7a deriya bolla hayqidosona. <verse eid="1CH 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2"/>Filisxeemeti Saa7olanne iya adde nayta gooddi efidi Saa7ola nayta Yoonataana, Abinadaabanne Malkisa wodhidosona. <verse eid="1CH 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3"/>Olay Saa7ola teqidi un7ethis; dongen dukeysati Saa7ola demmidi madunxisidosona.<verse eid="1CH 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4"/>Saa7oli ba ola miishiya tookeysako, “Ha qaxaretiboona Filisxeemeti tana kaa7onna mela ne mashshan tana wodha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 10:4">Shin iya ola miishiya tookeysi daro yayyida gisho ixis; hessa gisho, Saa7oli ba mashsha sa7an essidi iya bolla kundidi hayqis. <verse eid="1CH 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5"/>Iya ola miishiya tookeysi Saa7oli hayqidaysa be7idi, ika ba mashsha sa7an essidi iya bolla kundidi hayqis. <verse eid="1CH 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6"/>Hessada hanidi Saa7oli, iya heedzu naytinne iya soo asa ubbay he gallas hayqidosona. <verse eid="1CH 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7"/>Zangaaran de7iya Isra7eeleti ubbay banta olanchoti baqatidaysa, Saa7olinne iya nayti hayqidaysa be7ida wode banta katamata aggidi baqatidosona. Filisxeemeti yidi he katamatan de7idosona.<verse eid="1CH 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8"/>Wontetha gallas Filisxeemeti ahata bollafe ola miisheta qaari ekanaw yidi, Saa7olinne iya nayti Gilbo7a deriyan hayqidi, zin7idaysata demmidosona. <verse eid="1CH 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9"/>Enti Saa7ola qoodhiya qanxidi iya ola miishiya qaari ekidosona. Yaatidi banta eeqata keethaninne banta asaa giddon xoonuwa awaajana mela Filisxeeme biitta ubbaas ase kiittidosona. <verse eid="1CH 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10"/>Enti Saa7ola ola miishiya banta xoossata keethatape issuwan wothidosona; iya huuphiya banta Xoossa Daagona eeqa keethan kaqidosona.<verse eid="1CH 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11"/>Filisxeemeti Saa7ola bolla oothidaba ubbaa Galadan de7iya Yaabesa katamaa asay si7ida wode, <verse eid="1CH 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12"/>mino asati ubbay bidi, Saa7ola ahaanne iya nayta aha ekidi Yaabesa katama ehidosona. Yaabesan de7iya wolaa garsan enta moogidosona; yaatidi laapun gallas xoomidosona.<verse eid="1CH 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13"/>Saa7oli Godaas ammanetibona gisho hayqis. Godaa qaala I naagibeenna; Godaa zore oycheysa aggidi, <verse eid="1CH 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14"/>moytille xeegiya asi zore oychis. Hessa gisho, Goday iya wodhidi iya kawotetha Isseye na7aa Dawitas aathidi immis.<verse eid="1CH 10:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Isra7eele Bolla Kawotis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 5:1-10">1 Same 5:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1"/>Hessafe guye, Isra7eele asa ubbay issife Kebroonan de7iya Dawitako bidi, “Nuuni ne suuthunne ne asho. <verse eid="1CH 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2"/>Kase Saa7oli kawo gididi de7iya wodeka, Isra7eele asaa olas kaalethiday nena. Goday ne Xoossay, ‘Ta asaa Isra7eele neeni heemmana; enta bolla neeni kawotana’ ” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3"/>Isra7eele cimati ubbay kawa Dawitako yida wode I entara Kebroonan Godaa sinthan caaqis. Goday Sameela baggara odida qaalada Dawiti Isra7eele bolla kawotanaada enti iya tiyidosona.<verse eid="1CH 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4"/>Dawitinne Isra7eele asa ubbay Yerusalaame katamaa bidosona. He wode Yaabuse asay he bessan de7iya gisho he katamay Yaabuse geetetees. <verse eid="1CH 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5"/>Yaabuseti Dawitako, “Neeni ha katamaa gelanaw danda7aka” yaagidosona. Gidoshin, Dawiti Xiyoonen de7iya enta miixaa oykin, Xiyooney Dawita Katama geetetis. <verse eid="1CH 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6"/>Dawiti ba olanchota, “Yaabuseta koyrottidi oliya oonika toora mocona gidana” yaagis. Xaruya na7ay Iyo7aabi koyrottidi olidi halaqa gidis. <verse eid="1CH 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7"/>Dawiti he miixan de7ida gisho he katamay Dawita Katama geetetis.<verse eid="1CH 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8"/>Dawiti Miilope doomidi he katamaa zaaridi keexis; attida baggaa Iyo7aabi zaaridi keexis. <verse eid="1CH 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday iyara de7iya gisho Dawiti minni minni bis.<verse eid="1CH 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mino Gidida Dawita Asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2 Same 23:8-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10"/>Mino gidida Dawita asati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidosona. Goday Isra7eeles gida qaalada Dawiti kawotana mela ha asati Isra7eele asaara daro maaddidosona. Qassi iya kawotethaa minthidosona.<verse eid="1CH 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11"/>Mino gidida Dawita asati haysafe kaallidi de7eyisata. Entafe heedzati daro eretidaysata. Heedzatape koyroy Hakmoona addiya Yashobi7aama; I issi toho olan heedzu xeetu asaa ba tooran wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12"/>Iya kaalley, heedzu mino asatape issoy Ahoha addiya Dooda na7a Alaazara. <verse eid="1CH 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13"/>Filisxeeme asay oletanaw Pasdamima geetetiya bessaa shiiqida wode Alaazari Dawitara de7ees. Isra7eele olanchoti Filisxeeme asata sinthafe baqatiya wode Alaazari banga gaden de7ees. <verse eid="1CH 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14"/>Inne iya asati gadiya giddon Filisxeeme asaara oletin, Goday gita xoono immidi enta ashshis.<verse eid="1CH 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15"/>Filisxeeme olanchoti Raafayme zangaaran dunkaanida wode hastamu halaqatape heedzati Dawiti de7iya Adulaama gongoluwan de7iya zaallako bidosona. <verse eid="1CH 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16"/>He wode Dawiti miixan de7ees; Filisxeeme olanchotape issi cugay Beeteleme olidi oykis. <verse eid="1CH 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17"/>Dawiti haathe uyanaw amotidi, “Beeteleme pengiya matan de7iya pulto haathaafe tana ushshanay oone!” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18"/>Heedzu mino asati Filisxeemeti dunkaanida bessaa kanthi bidi Beeteleme pengiya matan de7iya pulto haathaafe duuqidi Dawitas ehidosona. Shin Dawiti uyonna ixidi haatha Godaa sinthan tigis. <verse eid="1CH 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19"/>“Ha haatha ushshi taape haako! Banta shempuwa bayzidi ehida ha asata suuthaa taani uyo? Enti banta shempuwa aathidi immidi ehidosona” yaagis. Hessa gisho, Dawiti haatha uybeenna. Heedzu mino asati hessa oothidosona.<verse eid="1CH 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20"/>Iyo7aaba ishay Abisi hastamu olanchotas halaqa. I ba tooran heedzu xeetu asaa wodhidi, ika ha heedzatada eretida asi gidis. <verse eid="1CH 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21"/>Abisi heedzatara taybetonna ixikoka, I heedzatape aadhidi bonchetida asi; I entaw halaqa gidis.<verse eid="1CH 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22"/>Qabxeela addey Yoodahe na7ay Banayi mino asi; I mino ooso oothis. I nam7u eretida Moo7abe asata wodhis. Qassi shachi wodhida issi gallas olla giddo gelidi gaammo wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23"/>Banayi ichashu wadha gidiya Gibxe addiya wodhis. Gibxe addiya kushen wandaraashe mela toori de7ees; shin Banayi xam7a oykidi addiyako bidi iya kushiyan de7iya toora dafi ekidi iya tooran iya wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24"/>Yoodahe na7ay Banayi haysa oothis. Iya sunthay he heedzataysada eretis. <verse eid="1CH 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25"/>I hastamata giddon daro bonchetis; shin I heedzata taybuwan deenna. Dawiti iya bana naageysata halaqa oothis.<verse eid="1CH 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26"/>Mino asati Iyo7aaba ishaa Asaheela, Beeteleme addiya Dooda na7aa Eliyaana, <verse eid="1CH 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27"/>Harooda addiya Samoota, Piloona addiya Selesa, <verse eid="1CH 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28"/>Tequhe addiya Esika na7aa Ira, Anatoota addiya Abi7ezera, <verse eid="1CH 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29"/>Kusata addiya Sabaka, Ahoha addiya Elaya, <verse eid="1CH 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30"/>Naxoofa addiya No7eeranne Banaha na7aa Heleda, <verse eid="1CH 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31"/>Biniyaamen de7iya Gib7a addiya Rabaya na7a Etaya, Pir7atoona addiya Banayasa, <verse eid="1CH 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32"/>Ga7aasa Zangaara matape yida Uraya, Araba addiya Abi7eela, <verse eid="1CH 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33"/>Barhuuma addiya Azmoota, Sa7alboona addiya Abi7eela, <verse eid="1CH 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34"/>Gizoona addiya Hasema, Harara addiya Shaage na7a Yoonataana, <verse eid="1CH 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35"/>Harara addiya Sakara na7a Ahi7aama, Ure na7aa Elfala, <verse eid="1CH 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36"/>Makeera addiya Hefeera, Piloona addiya Akiya, <verse eid="1CH 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37"/>Qarmeloosa addiya Hexira, Ezbaya na7aa Na7iraya, <verse eid="1CH 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38"/>Naatana ishaa Iyyu7eela, Hagira na7aa Mibhaara, <verse eid="1CH 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39"/>Amoone addiya Xeleqa, Xaruya na7aa Iyo7aaba ola miishiya tookiya Ba7eroota addiya Nahiraya, <verse eid="1CH 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40"/>Yatira addiya Iranne Gareeba, <verse eid="1CH 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41"/>Hite addiya Ooriyoona, Ahilaya na7aa Zabada, <verse eid="1CH 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42"/>Robeela koche gidida Shiiza na7aa Adina. I Robeela kochata halaqa; hastamati iyara issife de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43"/>Hara mino asati Ma7ika na7aa Hanaana, Mitaane addiya Iyosaafexa, <verse eid="1CH 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44"/>Astaroota addiya Ooziyana, Aro7eera addiya Hotama nayta Shama7anne Yi7eela, <verse eid="1CH 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45"/>Shimira na7aa Yidi7eelanne iya ishaa Tiixa addiya Yooha, <verse eid="1CH 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46"/>Mahaawa addiya Eli7eela, Elnaama nayta Yiribayanne Yoshawa, Moo7abe addiya Yitima, <verse eid="1CH 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47"/>Xooba addiya El7eela, Obeedanne Ya7isi7eela.<verse eid="1CH 11:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Kaallida Olanchota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1"/>Dawiti Qiisa na7aa Saa7olape baqatidi Xiqilaagan uttida wode iyako yida asati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. Enta kase Dawita olan maaddida mino asata giddon de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2"/>Enti dongen dukeyisata; qassi ushacha kusheninne haddirsa kushen yambaranawnne donge dukanaw danda7oosona. Enti Biniyaame koche gidida Saa7ola kochata. <verse eid="1CH 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3"/>Enta halaqay Ahi7ezera; iyape kaallidi Iyo7aasa; enti Gib7a addiya Shama7a na7a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:3">Harati qassi Azmaawe nayta gidida Yizi7eelanne Palaxa, Baraka, Anatoote addiya Iyyu, <verse eid="1CH 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4"/>hastamata giddon wolqaama gididi, enta kaalethiya Gaba7oona addiya Yishima7iya, Ermiyaasa, Yahazi7eela, Yohaana, Gedaara addiya Yozabaata, <verse eid="1CH 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5"/>Eluzaya, Yarmoota, Balaya, Samara, Harifa addiya Safaaxa, <verse eid="1CH 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6"/>Qore koche gidida Elqaana, Yishiya, Azari7eela, Yoo7ezeranne Yashobi7aama, <verse eid="1CH 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7"/>Gadoora addiya Yirohaama nayta Yo7eelanne Zabada.<verse eid="1CH 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8"/>Dawiti bazzon de7iya miixan de7ishin, Gaade kochaafe guutha asati iyako yidosona. Enti minonne olas giigidaysata; gondallenne toora oykanaw danda7eyisata. Enta som7oy gaammo som7o mela; enti dere huuphera gupiya gen7e mela eesotoosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9"/>Enta halaqay Exera; nam7anthoy abdiyu; heedzanthoy Eli7aaba; <verse eid="1CH 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10"/>oyddanthoy Mismaana; ichashanthoy Ermiyaasa; <verse eid="1CH 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11"/>usupunthoy Ataya; laapunthoy Eli7eela; <verse eid="1CH 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12"/>hospunthoy Yohaana; uddufunthoy Elzabaada; <verse eid="1CH 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13"/>tammanthoy Ermiyaasa; tammanne issanthoy Makibanaya. <verse eid="1CH 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14"/>Haysati Gaade kochaa olanchotas halaqata. Entafe ziqay mato halaqa; dhoqay qassi shaalaqa gidis. <verse eid="1CH 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15"/>Yordaanose shaafay, gaxape gaxa gakidi kixida koyro ageenan pinnidaysati haysata. Enti zangaaran dolohanne wuloha baggan de7iya asaa ubbaa yedethidosona.<verse eid="1CH 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16"/>Biniyaame kochaafenne Yihuda kochaafe guutha asati Dawiti de7iya miixa bidosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17"/>Dawiti entara gahetanaw keyidi, “Hinte tana maaddanaw saro taako yidaba gidiko ta wozanay hintera gidana. Shin hinte tana ta morketas aathidi immanaw yidaba gidiko, hintena erite! Taani oothida iitabay bayna gisho nu aawata Xoossay hessa be7o; I hintena pirdo!” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18"/>Hessafe guye, hastamata halaqa Amasaya bolla Xoossa Ayyaanay wodhin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">“Dawita, nuuni neyisata!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">Isseye na7aw, nuuni neera de7oos!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Saroy new gido!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">Nena maaddeysatas saroy gido!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Ne Xoossay nena maaddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 12:18">Dawiti enta ekidi ba olanchotas halaqa oothis.<verse eid="1CH 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19"/>Dawiti Filisxeemetara gididi Saa7ola olanaw bida wode, Minaase kochaafe guutha asati Dawitara gahetidosona. Shin Filisxeemeta halaqati Dawitinne Dawita asay bantara boonnada diggidosona. Dawitinne Dawita asay, enta kawa Saa7olas aathidi immaneko gidi yayyida gisho Filisxeemeti zoretidaape guye enta guye zaaridosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20"/>Dawiti Xiqilaaga simmida wode Minaase kochaafe Dawita maaddanaw keyida asati Adina, Yozabaata, Yidi7eela, Mika7eela, Yozabaata, Elihanne Xiltaya. Haysati kase Minaase biittan shaalaqa. <verse eid="1CH 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21"/>Enti ubbay minonne wolqaama asi gidiya gisho Dawita zugidi oliya asaa olidi iya maaddidosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22"/>Dawita olanchoti, Xoossa olanchoda darana gakanaw iya maaddiya asay gallas gallas guzhetees.<verse eid="1CH 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23"/>Goday iyaw gidaysada Saa7ola kawotethaa Dawitako zaaranaw dancetidi Dawitako Kebroona bida olanchota tayboy haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. <verse eid="1CH 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24"/>Gondallenne toora oykidi olas giigida Yihuda kochay 6,800. <verse eid="1CH 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25"/>Simoona kochaafe olas giigida minonne wolqaama olanchoti 7,100. <verse eid="1CH 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26"/>Leewe kochaafe 4,600. <verse eid="1CH 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27"/>Aarona kochaa halaqay Yoodahe; Yoodahera issife 3,700 asati de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28"/>Saadoqi na7atethi, minonne wolqaama asi; Saadoqa soo asaape laatamanne nam7u halaqati iyara de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29"/>Biniyaame koche gidida Saa7ola dabboti 3,000. Shin Biniyaame kochaafe dariya baggay Saa7ola soo asaas he wode gakanaw ammanetidosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30"/>Efreema kochaafe banta soo asan eretida minonne wolqaama asati 20,800. <verse eid="1CH 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31"/>Dawita kawoyanaw baanaw dooretida Minaase kochaafe baggati 18,000. <verse eid="1CH 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32"/>Isra7eele asay ay oothanaw bessiyako wodiyaba shaakidi eriya akeekancho asati, Yisakoora kochaa halaqati, nam7u xeeta; enta dabboti ubbay entaw kiitetoosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33"/>Ola miishe ubbaa oykidi banta kumetha wozanan Dawita maaddanaw giigida olanchotan Zabloona kochay 50,000. <verse eid="1CH 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34"/>Niftaaleme kochaafe 1,000 halaqatinne gondallenne toora oykiya 37,000 asati entara de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35"/>Daane kochaafe olas giigida asati 28,600. <verse eid="1CH 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36"/>Olas keyanaw Aseera kochaafe giigida asati 40,000. <verse eid="1CH 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37"/>Yordaanose shaafape hefintha doloha baggan de7iya Robeela kochaafe Gaade kochaafenne Minaase koche baggaafe ola miishe ubbaa oykidi yida asati 120,000.<verse eid="1CH 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38"/>Ha ubba olanchoti Dawita Isra7eele bolla kawothanaw banta qofaa qachidi, Kebroona katamaa yidosona. Qassi Isra7eelepe attidaysati Dawita kawothanaw issi wozanan gididosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39"/>Enta dabboti entaw koshshiyaba giigisida gisho mishenne uyishe Dawitara heedzu gallas uttidosona. <verse eid="1CH 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40"/>Isra7eele asaas ufaysi gidiya gisho, pudeha baggan de7iya Yisakoorape, Zabloonapenne Niftaalemepe daro asay dhiille, balase nuka, woyne teera, woyne ushshunne zayte haren, baqulon, gimaleninne booran caanidi ehidosona; qassi enti mehenne dorse shukidi maanaw ehidosona.<verse eid="1CH 12:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Taabotey Isra7eele Simmis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2 Same 6:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1"/>Dawiti shaalaqataranne mato halaqatara zoretis. <verse eid="1CH 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2"/>Isra7eele asa ubbaa, “Hintew lo77o daaniyaba gidikonne Godaa nu Xoossaa shene gidiko, Isra7eele biitta gaxan de7iya nu dabboti, hessadaka banta katamataninne hentha bessatan de7iya kahinetinne Leeweti nuuko shiiqana mela ase kiittoos. <verse eid="1CH 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3"/>Saa7ola kawotethaa wode qeli geetetida nu Xoossaa Taabotiya ane zaaridi ehoos” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4"/>Dawita oday lo77o gidida gisho asa ubbay ma7is.<verse eid="1CH 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5"/>Hessa gisho, Dawiti Xoossa Taabotiya Qiriyaat-Yi7aarimepe ehana mela Gibxe zawape doomidi Hamaata Pino gakanaw de7iya Isra7eele asa ubbaa shiishis. <verse eid="1CH 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6"/>Dawitinne Isra7eele asa ubbay kiruubetape giddon ba araata bolla uttida Godaa sunthay xeegetida Xoossa Taabotiya ehanaw Yihuda biittan de7iya Baala geetetiya Qiriyat-Yi7aarima bidosona. <verse eid="1CH 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7"/>Xoossa Taabotiya ooratha para gaaren wothidi, Amnadaabe soope ehidosona; Oozinne Ahiyoy gaariya laaggoosona. <verse eid="1CH 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8"/>Dawitinne Isra7eele asa ubbay diithinne maasinqo kaa7ishe, karaabo baqishe, daala giirsishe, zaye punnishe banta kumetha wolqan Xoossa sinthan ufaytidi, yexishe Xoossaa bonchidosona.<verse eid="1CH 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9"/>Enti Kidoona wudumma gakiya wode boorati dhubetida gisho Oozi Taabotiya oykanaw ba kushiya yeddis. <verse eid="1CH 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10"/>Ooza kushey Taabotiya bochida gisho, Godaa hanqoy Oza bolla eexis. Hessa gisho, Goday iya xadikin, I he bessan Xoossa sinthan hayqis.<verse eid="1CH 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11"/>Goday hanqetidi Ooza wodhida gisho, Dawiti yilotis. Hachi gakanaw he bessay Oozi dhuketida bessaa geetetees. <verse eid="1CH 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12"/>He gallas Dawiti Xoossaa yayyida gisho, “Xoossa Taabotiya taako waata ehanaw danda7iyana?” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13"/>Dawiti Taabotiya Yerusalaame efanaape gidi Gaate addiya Abdaara soo efis. <verse eid="1CH 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14"/>Xoossa Taabotey Abdaara son iya soo asaara heedzu ageena gam7is. Goday iya soo asaanne iyaw de7iya ubbaa anjis.<verse eid="1CH 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Soo Asaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">2 Same 5:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1"/>Xiroosa kawoy Kiraami Dawitas gadho keexana mela kiitetiya asata, shuchu masseysatanne anaaxeta ziga mithara yeddis. <verse eid="1CH 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2"/>Goday Isra7eele bolla iya kawo oothidi minthidaysanne ba asaa Isra7eele gisho iya kawotethaa bonchidaysa Dawiti eris.<verse eid="1CH 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti Yerusalaamen hara macho ekidi adde naytanne macca nayta yelis. <verse eid="1CH 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4"/>Dawiti Yerusalaamen yelida adde nayti Samuusa, Sobaaba, Naatana, Solomone, <verse eid="1CH 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5"/>Yibhaara, Elisu7a, Elfalaxa, <verse eid="1CH 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6"/>Noga, Nafega, Yafaya, <verse eid="1CH 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7"/>Elisaama, Eldaana, Elfalaxa.<verse eid="1CH 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Filisxeemeta Xoonis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2 Same 5:17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8"/>Dawiti Isra7eele ubbaa bolla kawo gididi tiyetidaysa Filisxeemeti si7ida wode ubbay Dawita olidi oykanaw keyidosona. Dawiti hessa si7idi entara oletanaw keyis. <verse eid="1CH 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9"/>Filisxeemeti Raafayme zangaara yidi oykidosona. <verse eid="1CH 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10"/>Dawiti, “Taani Filisxeemeta olo? Neeni enta taw aatha immanee?” yaagidi Xoossaa oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 14:10">Goday, “Bada ola; taani enta new aatha immana” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11"/>Dawitinne iya asay Ba7al-Parasime geetetiya bessaa bidi yan enta xoonidosona. Dawiti, “Haathi dhuusidi keyeysada Xoossay ta morketa giddora tana kanthisis” yaagis. He bessaa sunthay Ba7al-Parasime geetetis. <verse eid="1CH 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12"/>Filisxeemeti banta eeqata he bessan yeggidi bin, Dawiti kiittidi enta eeqata xuugisis.<verse eid="1CH 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13"/>Filisxeemeti zaari he zangaara yidi olidosona. <verse eid="1CH 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14"/>Dawiti Xoossaa zaaridi oychis. Xoossay, “Enta guyera yuuya aadhada wolaa matan eqada olape attishin, sintha baggara keyopa. <verse eid="1CH 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15"/>Wola huuphen salpe girsi neeni si7iya wode olanaw keya. Hessi Filisxeeme olanchota shocanaw Xoossay neepe sinthe aadhidaysas malla” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16"/>Xoossay kiitidaysada Dawiti oothis. Gaba7oonape Gezera gakanaw Isra7eele asay Filisxeeme olanchota wodhidosona. <verse eid="1CH 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17"/>Dawita sunthay biitta ubbaa gakis. Kawotetha ubbay Dawitas yayyana mela Goday oothis.<verse eid="1CH 14:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Taabotey Yerusalaame Simmis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1"/>Dawiti ba kataman baw keethe keexis; Xoossa Taabotiyas besse giigisidi, dunkaane essis. <verse eid="1CH 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2"/>Dawiti, “Xoossa Taabotiya tookanaadanne merinaw Xoossas oothanaada Goday dooriday Leeweta gidiya gisho hari oonika Xoossa Taabotiya tookanaw bessenna” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3"/>Dawiti Godaa Taabotiyas giigisida bessaa Taabotiya ehana mela Isra7eele asa ubbaa Yerusalaame shiishis. <verse eid="1CH 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4"/>Kaallidi Dawiti Aarona kochatanne Leeweta xeegidi shiishis. <verse eid="1CH 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5"/>Qahaata yaraape halaqay Uri7eelinne issi xeetanne laatamu iya dabboti yidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6"/>Maraara yaraape halaqay Asayinne nam7u xeetanne laatamu iya dabboti yidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7"/>Gedisoona yaraape halaqay Iyyu7eelinne xeetanne hastamu iya dabboti yidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8"/>Elzafaana yaraape halaqay Shama7inne nam7u xeetu iya dabboti yidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9"/>Kebroona yaraape halaqay Eli7eelinne hospun tammu iya dabboti yidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10"/>Uzi7eela yaraape halaqay Amnadaabeynne xeetanne tammanne nam7u iya daboti yidosona.<verse eid="1CH 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11"/>Dawiti kahineta Saadoqanne Abyataara, Leeweta Uri7eela, Asaya, Iyyu7eela, Shama7a, Eli7eelanne Amnadaabe xeegis. <verse eid="1CH 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12"/>Entako, “Hinte Leewe kochaas halaqata. Godaa Isra7eele Xoossaa Taabotiya taani giigisida bessaa ehanaw hintenne hinte dabboti geeyite. <verse eid="1CH 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13"/>Hinte Leeweti koyro Xoossa Taabotiya tookiboonna gishonne nuuni iya woga mela waati efaneko Xoossaa oychiboona gisho, Goday nu Xoossay nuna seeris” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14"/>Godaa Isra7eele Xoossa Taabotiya ehanaw kahinetinne Leeweti bantana geeshshidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15"/>Goday Muse baggara kase kiitidaysada Leeweti Xoossaa Taabotiya banta hashiyan kasora tookidosona.<verse eid="1CH 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16"/>Diithi, maasinqonne daala kaa7ishe ufaysa yethi yexana mela banta dabbo gidida Leewetape zammaareta shuumana mela Dawiti kiittis. <verse eid="1CH 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17"/>Leeweti Iyyu7eela na7aa Hemaana, iya dabbotape Baraka na7aa Asaafanne enta dabbotape Maraara yaraa Qusaya na7aa Etaana shuumidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18"/>Qassi nam7antho dethan Zakariyasa, Yazi7eela, Shamramoota, Yi7eela, Una, Eli7aaba, Banaya, Ma7iseya, Matita, Elfala, Miqineyanne penge naagiya Abdiyunne Yi7eela shuumidosona.<verse eid="1CH 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19"/>Naase daala qaathana mela Hemaani Asaafinne Etaani shuumetidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20"/>Qassi Zakariyasi, Ya7izi7eeli, Shamramooti, Yi7eeli, Uni, Eli7aabi, Ma7iseynne Banayi maasinqo kaa7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21"/>Matita, Elfali, Miqineyi, Abdiyuy Yi7eelinne Azaazey diithi diixoosona.<verse eid="1CH 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22"/>Leeweta halaqay Kanaaney mazmure eriya gisho enta kaalethanaw shuumetis. <verse eid="1CH 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23"/>Barakinne Elqaani Taabotiya dunkaaniya pengiya naaganaw dooretidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24"/>Kahineti Sabaani, Iyosaafexi, Natina7eeli, Amasayi, Zakariyasi, Banayinne Alaazari Xoossa Taabotiya sinthan moyze punnanaw dooretidosona. Obeed-Edoomeynne Yihey Taabotiya naaganaw dooretidosona.<verse eid="1CH 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25"/>Dawiti, Isra7eele cimatinne shaalaqati Godaa caaqo Taabotiya Abdaara soope ehanaw ufaytishe bidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26"/>Godaa caaqo Taabotiya tookida Leeweta Xoossay maaddida gisho enti laapun kormanne laapun maraze yarshidosona. <verse eid="1CH 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27"/>Dawiti, Taabotiya tookida Leeweti, mazmure yexeysatinne enta halaqay Kanaaney liinope oosetida ma7o ma7idosona. Dawitika liinope oosetida efuude ma7is. <verse eid="1CH 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28"/>Hessada oothidi, Isra7eele ubbay ufaytidi moyzenne zaye punnishe, daala qaathishe, diithinne maasinqo kaa7ishe Godaa caaqo Taabotiya ehidosona.<verse eid="1CH 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29"/>Godaa caaqo Taabotey Dawita katamaa gelida wode Saa7ola na7iya Melkoola kawoy Dawiti ufaytidi durishininne kaa7ishin maskootera be7ada ba wozanan kadhasu.<verse eid="1CH 15:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1"/>Enti Xoossa Taabotiya ehidi Dawiti Taabotiya wothanaw essida dunkaaniya giddon wothidi, xuussa yarshonne issifetetha yarsho Xoossas yarshidosona. <verse eid="1CH 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2"/>Dawiti xuussa yarshonne issifetetha yarsho yarshidi polidaape guye Godaa sunthan asaa anjis. <verse eid="1CH 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3"/>Isra7eele asa ubbaas maccasinne addes, huuphen huuphen issi muume uythi, issi qanxo ashonne issi woyne nuka gishis.<verse eid="1CH 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4"/>Godaa Taabotiya sinthan oothana melanne Godaa Isra7eele Xoossaa sabbana mela, galatana melanne bonchana mela guutha Leeweta Dawiti shuumis. <verse eid="1CH 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5"/>Leeweta halaqay Asaafa; Asaafa kaallidi Zakariyasa. Zakariyasa kaallidi de7ey Yi7eela, Shamramoota, Yi7eela, Matita, Eli7aaba, Banayanne Obeed-Edoome. Enti maasinqonne diithi diixanaw shuumetidosona; shin Asaafi daala girsanaw shuumetis. <verse eid="1CH 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6"/>Kahiney Banayinne Yahazi7eeli Xoossa caaqo Taabotiya sinthan ubba wode moyze punnanaw shuumetidosona. <verse eid="1CH 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7"/>He gallas Dawiti Asaafinne iya dabboti Godaa sabbana mela ha mazmuriya koyro kiittis.<verse eid="1CH 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galata Mazmure</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Maz 105:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8"/>Godaa galatite; iya sunthaa xeegite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:8">Iya oosuwa kawotethata giddon odite.<verse eid="1CH 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9"/>Iya sabbite; galata mazmuriya iyaw yexite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:9">Malaalisiya iya ooso ubbaa odite.<verse eid="1CH 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10"/>Iya geeshsha sunthan ceeqetite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:10">Godaa koyeyisata wozanay ufayto.<verse eid="1CH 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11"/>Godaanne iya wolqaa be7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:11">ubba wode iya sinthaa koyite.<verse eid="1CH 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12-13"/>Hinteno, Isra7eele kochato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:12-13">dooretida Yayqooba nayto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:12-13">Iya malaata, I immida pirdaanne malaalsiyabata hassayite.<verse eid="1CH 16:12-13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14"/>I Godaa nu Xoossaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:14">iya pirday biitta ubbaa bollana.<verse eid="1CH 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15"/>Iya caaquwa merinaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:15">mukulu yeletethaa gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:15">iya qaala naagite.<verse eid="1CH 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16"/>Abrahaamera caaqida caaquwa naagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:16">Yisaaqas gelida qaala minthees.<verse eid="1CH 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17"/>Yayqoobas wogaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:17">Isra7eeles merinaa caaquwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:17">oothidi minthis.<verse eid="1CH 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18"/>“Taani new Kanaane biitta immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:18">I ne kochaas laata gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19"/>Hessi hinte taybon guuthanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:19">Kanaanen bete gididi de7iya wode hannis.<verse eid="1CH 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20"/>Issi deriyape hara dere pinnidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:20">issi kawotethaafe hara kawotethi yuuyidosona.<verse eid="1CH 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21"/>Xoossay enta oonika naaqana mela immibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:21">enta gisho kawota seeris.<verse eid="1CH 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22"/>“Taani tiyidaysata bochofite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:22">ta nabeta qohopite” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23"/>Sa7an de7iya asa ubbay Godaas yexite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:23">iya ashuwa gallas gallas odite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">Maz 96:1-13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1CH 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24"/>Kawotethata giddon iya bonchuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:24">malaalsiya iya oosuwa asa ubbaa giddon awaajite.<verse eid="1CH 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25"/>Goday gita; aadho galatay iyaw bessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:25">xoossata ubbaafe aadhidi bonchetanaw bessees.<verse eid="1CH 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26"/>Hara kawotethata xoossati ubbay eeqata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:26">shin Goday salota medhida Xoossaa.<verse eid="1CH 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27"/>Iya sinthan bonchoynne teemi de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:27">minotethinne ufaysi I de7iya bessan de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28"/>Hinteno, biitta kawotethato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:28">Godaa bonchonne wolqa immite.<verse eid="1CH 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29"/>Iya sunthaas bessiya boncho immite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:29">yarsho ekidi iya sinthe yiite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:29">iya geeshshatetha teeman Godaa goyinnite.<verse eid="1CH 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30"/>Biittan de7iya asa ubbay iya sinthan kokorite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:30">Sa7ay minni eqida gisho qaaxenna.<verse eid="1CH 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31"/>Saloti ufayto; sa7i hashshu go!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:31">Kawotethata giddon enti “Goday kawotis!” yaago.<verse eid="1CH 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32"/>Abbaynne iya giddon de7iya ubbay guummo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:32">gadeynne iyan de7iya katha ubbay ufayto.<verse eid="1CH 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33"/>He wode woran de7iya mitha ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:33">ufaysan Godaa sinthan yexana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:33">I sa7aa bolla pirdanaw yees.<verse eid="1CH 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34"/>Goday keeha gidiya gishonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:34">iya siiqoy merinaasa gidiya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:34">Godaa galatite.<verse eid="1CH 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35"/>“Abeeti nuna ashshiya Xoossaw nuna ashsha;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">Maz 106:47-48</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">Nuuni ne geeshsha suntha galatana melanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">ne bonchuwan nu bonchetana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">kawotethata giddofe shiishada nuna ashsha” yaagite.<verse eid="1CH 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36"/>Goday Isra7eele Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:36">merinaape merinaa gakanaw galatetto!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">Asa ubbay, “Amin7i” gidi, Godaa galatidosona.<verse eid="1CH 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37"/>Godaa caaqo Taabotiya sinthan gallas gallas goyinnoos koshshiyaba ubba wode enti oothana mela Dawiti Asaafanne iya dabbota wothis. <verse eid="1CH 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38"/>Qassi Obeed-Edoomenne usupun tammanne hospun iya dabbota entara oothana mela wothis; Yedutuuna na7aa Obeed-Edoomenne Hosa pengiya naagana mela wothis.<verse eid="1CH 16:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39"/>Kahiney Saadoqinne iyara oothiya kahineti Gaba7oonan de7iya dhoqa bessan, Dunkaaniya sinthan oothana mela enta yan aggis. <verse eid="1CH 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40"/>Goday Isra7eeles immida higgiyan xaafetidaysada enti wontanne omarsi ubba wode xuussa yarsho yarshana mela oothis. <verse eid="1CH 16:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41"/>Iya siiqoy merinaasa gidiya gisho Godaa mazmuren galatana mela Hemaana, Yedutuunanne dooretida harata Dawiti entara issife wothis. <verse eid="1CH 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42"/>Hemaaninne Yedutuuni moyze punnoosona, daala giirsoosona galata mazmure yexishe kaa7iya hara miisheta kaa7oosona. Yedutuuna adde nayti pengiya naaganaw shuumetidosona.<verse eid="1CH 16:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43"/>Hessafe guye asa ubbay ba soo soo bis. Dawitika ba soo asaa anjanaw simmis.<verse eid="1CH 16:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Naatani Dawitas Odida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Same 7:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1"/>Dawiti ba gadhon uttidaape guye nabiya Naatanako, “Taani zigape keexetida keethan de7ayis; shin Godaa caaqo Taabotey dunkaane giddon de7ees” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2"/>Naatani Dawitako, “Goday neera de7iya gisho ne wozanay qopidaba ubbaa ootha” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3"/>Shin he qamma Godaa qaalay Naatanako haysada yaagishe yis; <verse eid="1CH 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4"/>“Bada ta aylliya Dawitako haysada yaaga; ‘taani daana keethe keexanay nena gidaka. <verse eid="1CH 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5"/>Taani Isra7eele Gibxefe kessida wodepe doomada hachi gakanaw keethan de7abike; taani dunkaanepe dunkaane, bessafe bessi yuuyashe de7as. <verse eid="1CH 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6"/>Taani Isra7eele asa ubbaara yuuyida bessa ubban, ta asaa heemmana mela taani shuumida asaape oona Taw ziga keethi ayis keexabikii?’ gada oychabike” yaagees.<verse eid="1CH 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7"/>“Hessa gisho, ta aylliya Dawitako bada Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees; ‘Taani nena dorse heemmiya bessape denthada ta asaa Isra7eele kaalethana mela ehas. <verse eid="1CH 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8"/>Neeni bida besse ubban taani neera gidas; ne morketa ubbaa ne sinthafe diggas. Hiza taani ha sa7an eretida gita asaada ne sunthaa gitayana. <verse eid="1CH 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9"/>Taani ta asaa Isra7eeles besse immada, enta he bessan tokana. Hessa gisho, enti banta bessan de7ana; enti zaaridi waabaqokona. Kase taani ta asaa Isra7eele bolla daynnata shuumada wode morketi naaqidaysada, <verse eid="1CH 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10"/>zaaridi iita asati enta naaqokona. Taani ne morketa ubbaa new haarsana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 17:10">“ ‘Hessa bolla Goday ba huuphen new keethe keexanaysa odees. <verse eid="1CH 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11"/>Ne hayqada ne mayzatan gahetiya wode taani neepe guye ne naytape issuwa denthada iya kawotethaa minthana. <verse eid="1CH 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12"/>Taw keethe keexanay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keethe keexanay: Ha bessan keethe keexanay geetetiya soo asaa woyko sheesha woyko yeletetha dichanay iya guussu. Paydo 17, 23, 24, 25, 27 xeella </char></note> iya; taani iya araata merinaw mintha essana. <verse eid="1CH 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13"/>Taani iyaw aawa gidana; ika taw na7a gidana. Neepe sinthe kawotida Saa7olape ta maarotetha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maarotetha: ha bessan odetida maarotethay duuxonna siiqo woyko merinaw aggonna siiqo woyko laametonna siiqo guussu.</char></note> ekidaysada taani iyape ekike. <verse eid="1CH 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14"/>Taani iya ta asaa bollanne ta kawotethaa bolla merinaw shuumana; iya araatay merinaw minni eqana’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15"/>Naatani Xoossay iyaw qoncisida qaala ubbaa Dawitas odis.<verse eid="1CH 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Woosa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2 Same 7:18-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16"/>Hessafe guye, kawoy Dawiti dunkaaniya giddo gelidi, Godaa sinthan uttidi, haysada yaagidi woossis; “Abeeti Godaw, Xoossaw neeni haysa ubbaa taw oothanaw taani oonee? Ta soo asayka aybee? <verse eid="1CH 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17"/>Abeeti Godaw, hessi ne ayfiya sinthan guutha daanin, ne aylliya soo asaas sinthafe hananaba odadasa. Neeni tana gita asi oothada xeelladasa. <verse eid="1CH 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18"/>Neeni tana ne aylliya bonchida gisho, Dawiti ay gaanaw danda7ii? Neeni tana ne aylliya eraasa. <verse eid="1CH 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19"/>Abeeti Godaw, ne aylliya gishonne ne wozanaa qofaada ha gitaba ubbaa oothada, ha gita ufaysa qaala ubbaa tana erisadasa. <verse eid="1CH 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20"/>Abeeti Godaw, ne meli oonika baawa. Nuuni nu haythan si7idaysada neepe attishin, hara xoossi baawa. <verse eid="1CH 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21"/>Neeni ne ase oothanaw wozida ne asaa Isra7eele daaniya hara kawotethi sa7a bolla baawa. Neeni oothida gitanne malaalsiya oosota gaason ne sunthay biittan eretis. Neeni Gibxefe wozida ne asaa sinthafe kawotethata goodda kessadasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:7">Zaare 4:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1CH 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22"/>Neeni ne asaa Isra7eele merinaw nebaa oothadasa. Abeeti Godaw, neeni enta Xoosse gidadasa.<verse eid="1CH 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23"/>“Abeeti Godaw, neeni ne aylliyasinne iya soo asaas odidabay merinaw minnidi de7o; neeni oothana gidaysada ootha. <verse eid="1CH 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24"/>‘Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay tuma Isra7eele Xoosse’ asay gaanada ne sunthay merinaw minnidi daananne gita gidana. Ne aylliya Dawita soo asay ne sinthan minnidi daana.<verse eid="1CH 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25"/>“Abeeti ta Xoossaw, neeni ne aylliyas keethe keexana gada qoncisadasa. Hessa gisho, taani ne aylley ha woosa woossanaw minnas. <verse eid="1CH 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26"/>Abeeti Godaw, neeni Xoosse! Neeni ha lo77o ufaysa qaala taw ne aylliyas oothana gadasa. <verse eid="1CH 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27"/>Ne sinthan merinaw daana mela ne aylliya soo asaa anjanaw koyadasa. Abeeti Godaw, ne anjidaysi merinaw anjetidaysa gidana” yaagidi woossis.<verse eid="1CH 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Xoonota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">2 Same 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti Filisxeemeta xoonidi haaris; Geete katamaanne iya gutata Filisxeemeta kushepe ekis. <verse eid="1CH 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2"/>Dawiti Moo7abe asaa xoonin, enti iyaw haaretidi giiridosona.<verse eid="1CH 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3"/>Hamaata katamaa matan de7iya Suubba kawoy Adraazari, ba kawotetha Efraxiisa shaafa gakanaw aassanaw bishin Dawiti iya olis. <verse eid="1CH 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4"/>Dawiti Adraazarape issi mukulu para gaareta, laapun mukulu para asatanne laatamu mukulu toho asata di77is. Dawiti xeetu gaaretas gidiya parata ashshidi hara parata ubbaas gedaa xaphuwa qanxis.<verse eid="1CH 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5"/>Damasqo kataman de7iya Sooreti Suubba kawa Adraazara maaddanaw yida wode Dawiti entafe 22,000 asaa wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6"/>Hessafe guye, Soore biittan Damasqo kataman ola miixa medhis. Soore asati Dawitas haaretidi giiridosona. Dawiti bida bessa ubban Goday iyaw xoono immis.<verse eid="1CH 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7"/>Dawiti Adraazara oosanchoti tookida worqa gondalleta ekidi Yerusalaame efis. <verse eid="1CH 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8"/>Qassi Dawiti Adraazari haariya Xebahanne Kuna katamatape daro naase birata ekis. Hessafe guye, Solomoney he naase biratape oosetida kereta, tuussatanne dumma dumma miisheta oothis.<verse eid="1CH 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9"/>Dawiti Suubba kawa Adraazara olanchota ubbaa xoonidaysa Hamaata kawoy Toyi si7is. <verse eid="1CH 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10"/>Toyi Adrazaarara oletishe gam7ida gisho Dawiti Adraazara olidi xoonida gisho iya hashshu gaanawunne sarothanaw ba na7aa Hadoraama kawa Dawitako kiittis. Hadoraami worqafe, birapenne naase biratape oosetida miisheta imota ekidi bis. <verse eid="1CH 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11"/>Kawoy Dawiti Edoomepe, Moo7abepe, Amoonepe, Filisxeemetapenne Amaaleqatape di77idi ekida biraanne worqa ha miishetara gathidi Godaas dummayidi wothis.<verse eid="1CH 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12"/>Xaruya na7ay Abisi Edoome asaape 18,000 asaa, Maxine Zangaaran wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13"/>Dawiti Edoomen ola miixa medhis; yaatin, he biitta asa ubbay Dawitas haaretis. Dawiti bida bessa ubban Goday iyaw xoono immis.<verse eid="1CH 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14"/>Hessada oothidi, Dawiti Isra7eele ubbaa bolla kawotidi ba asa ubbaa xillotethaninne suure pirdan aysis. <verse eid="1CH 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15"/>Xaruya na7ay Iyo7aabi toora mocona; Ahiluda na7ay Iyosaafexi taarike xaafe. <verse eid="1CH 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16"/>Ahixuuba na7ay Saadoqinne Abyataara na7ay Abimelekey kahine; Sarayi waanna xaafe. <verse eid="1CH 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17"/>Yoodahe na7ay Banayi Dawita naagiya asaa halaqa; Dawita adde nayti iya kawotethan dhoqa bessa oykida halaqata.<verse eid="1CH 18:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Amooneta Xoonuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">2 Same 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1"/>Hessafe guye, Amoone kawoy Na7oosi hayqin iya na7ay iya bessan kawotis. <verse eid="1CH 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2"/>Dawiti, “Iya aaway Na7oosi taw keehida gisho taani iya na7aa Hanunas keehana” yaagis. Hanuna aaway hayqida gisho Dawiti iya minthethanaw ase kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 19:2">Dawiti kiitida asati Hanuna minthethanaw Amoone gakida wode, <verse eid="1CH 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3"/>Amoone moorinnati Hanunako, “Dawiti ne aawa bonchidi nena minthethanaw ha asata kiittis gada na qopay? I ha asaa kiittiday ha katamaa wochidi, olanaasa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="1CH 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4"/>Hanuni Dawiti kiitida asata oykidi, enta buuchaa meedis; enta ma7uwa garsafe dulle gakanaw qanxidi enta yeddis. <verse eid="1CH 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5"/>Hessa gisho, asati daro yeellatidosona. Dawiti hessa si7idi, entara asi kiittidi, “Hinte buuchay diccana gakanaw Iyaarko kataman de7ite; hessafe guye haa yiite” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6"/>Amooneti banta kushen Dawiti enta morkana mela oothidaysa erida wode Masephexoomeninne Sooren de7iya Ma7ikanne Suubba katamatape para gaaretanne parata garxanaw 34,000 kilo giraame bira santime yeddidosona. <verse eid="1CH 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7"/>32,000 para gaareta, parata, Ma7ika kawanne iya olanchota miishen garxin yidi Medaban dunkaanidosona. Qassi Amooneti banta katamaape keyidi olas giigetidosona.<verse eid="1CH 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8"/>Dawiti hessa si7ida wode Iyo7aabanne olanchota yeddis. <verse eid="1CH 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9"/>Amooneti keyidi katamaa pengen olas salpidosona. Enta maaddanaw yida kawoti banta bessaa oykidi denban shiiqidosona.<verse eid="1CH 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10"/>Iyo7aabi oli sintharanne guyera teqidaysa be7ida wode Isra7eeleta giddofe mino olanchota dooridi, Soore olanchota sinthan salpisis. <verse eid="1CH 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11"/>Attida asaa ba ishaa Abisa aawatetha garsan wothis; enti Amooneta sinthan salpidosona. <verse eid="1CH 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12"/>Iyo7aabi ba ishaa Abisako, “Soore asati ta bolla wolqaamiko, neeni yada tana maadda. Amoone asati ne bolla wolqaamiko, taani yada nena maaddana. <verse eid="1CH 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13"/>Hiza minna! Nu asaa gishonne nu Xoossaa katamata gisho ane minnidi oletoos. Goday bana lo77iyaba ootho” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14"/>Hessafe guye, Iyo7aabinne iyara de7iya asay Soore olanchotara oletanaw keyidosona. Yaatin, Soore asay iya sinthafe baqatidosona. <verse eid="1CH 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15"/>Soore asay baqatidaysa Amoone asay be7ida wode entika iya ishaa Abisaya sinthafe baqatidi katama gelidosona. Hessafe guye, Iyo7aabi Yerusalaame simmis.<verse eid="1CH 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16"/>Soore asay Isra7eele asay enta xoonidaysa erida wode ase kiittidi Efraxiisa shaafape hefinthara de7iya Soore asaa ehidosona. Toora moconay Adraazari, Shofaaki enta kaalethees.<verse eid="1CH 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17"/>Dawiti hessa si7ida wode Isra7eele olanchota shiishidi, Yordaanose shaafa pinnidi Soore asaara oletanaw enta sinthan salpidosona. Dawiti entara oletanaw salpin entika iyara oletidosona. <verse eid="1CH 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18"/>Soore asay Isra7eeleta sinthafe baqatidosona; Dawiti Soore asaape para gaare laagiya 7,000 asaanne 40,000 toho asaanne enta toora mocona Shoofaka wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19"/>Adraazara olanchoti Isra7eeletan xoonetidaysa erida wode Dawitara sigetidi, iyaw haaretidosona. Hessafe guye, Soore asay Amoone asaa maaddanaw dosibookona.<verse eid="1CH 19:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Raaba Olidi Oykis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">2 Same 12:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1"/>Laytha laamen kawoti olas keyiya wode Iyo7aabi olanchota kaalethidi Amoone biitta olidi Raaba katamaa oykis. Shin Dawiti Yerusalaamen attis; Iyo7aabi Raaba katamaa olidi dhaysis. <verse eid="1CH 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti yidi enta kawa worqa kallachaa iya huuphepe ekis. Kallacha deexoy hastamanne oyddu kilo giraame gidis; iya giddon al7o shuchi de7ees. He kallachaa ekidi Dawiti ba huuphen wothis. Qassi Dawiti he katamaape daro di7o di77is. <verse eid="1CH 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3"/>Kataman de7iya asaa kessidi magaazen, konteninne kaltan oosisis. Amoonen de7iya asa ubbaa hessada oosisis. Hessafe guye, Dawitinne iya asa ubbay Yerusalaame simmis.<verse eid="1CH 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filisxeemetara Oletida Ola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 21:15-22">2 Same 21:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4"/>Hessafe guye, Filisxeemera Gezeran oli dendin, Kusata addey Sabaki, Raafayme yara gidida Sifaya wodhis. Yaatin, Filisxeemeti xoonetidosona.<verse eid="1CH 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5"/>Filisxeemetara dendida hara olan qassi Ya7ira na7ay Eliyaani, toora toomay wandaraashe mela gidida, Geete addiya Gooliyada ishaa, Lahima wodhis.<verse eid="1CH 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6"/>Qassi hara oli Geeten dendis. He bessan issi wogga adussa addey de7ees. He addiyas issi issi kushiyaninne issi issi tohuwan usupun, woli bolla laatamanne oyddu biradheti de7oosona. Ika Raafa yara. <verse eid="1CH 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7"/>He uray Isra7eeletara qeeletida wode Dawita ishaa Sam7a na7ay Yoonataani iya wodhis. <verse eid="1CH 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8"/>Haysati Geeten de7iya Raafa yarata; enti Dawita kusheninne iya asaa kushen hayqidosona.<verse eid="1CH 20:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Asaa Taybis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2 Same 24:1-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1"/>Xalehey Isra7eele bolla meto ehanaw koyidi, Dawiti Isra7eele asaa taybana mela denthethis. <verse eid="1CH 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2"/>Dawiti Iyo7aabakonne toora moconatako, “Daanepe Barsaabe gakanaw bidi, Isra7eele asaa taybite. Yaatidi, asaa tayboy aapuneko tana erisite” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3"/>Shin Iyo7aabi, “Goday, ha de7iya ba asaa bolla xeetu kushe gujo! Ta godaw, kawaw, enti ubbay ta godaa aylleta gidokonaayee? Ta goday hessa melaba oothanaw ayis koyii? Isra7eele bolla ayis bala oothay?” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4"/>Shin kawa qaalay Iyo7aaba xoonin, Iyo7aabi keyidi Isra7eele biitta ubbaa yuuyidi Yerusalaame simmis. <verse eid="1CH 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5"/>Iyo7aabi taybida asaa taybuwa Dawitas immis. Isra7eele biitta ubban mashshan oletanaw danda7iya issi 1,100,000 asati de7oosona. Qassi Yihuda biittan mashshan oletanaw danda7iya 470,000 asati de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6"/>Iyo7aabi kawa kiitta dosiboonna gisho Leewetanne Biniyaame kochata taybeenna.<verse eid="1CH 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7"/>Xoossay hessan ufaytiboonna gisho Isra7eele seeris. <verse eid="1CH 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8"/>Dawiti Xoossaako, “Taani haysan gita nagara oothas. Shin ha77i nena woossayis; ne aylliya nagaraa atto ga; taani daro eeyaba hanas” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9"/>Goday Dawita qoncethi be7iya Gaadeko haysada yaagis; <verse eid="1CH 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10"/>“Bada Dawitako, Goday, ‘Taani nena heedzu dooro bessayis; taani ne bolla oothana mela entafe taw issuwa doora’ yaagees” yaaga.<verse eid="1CH 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11"/>Gaadi Dawitako bidi, “Goday haysatape issuwa doora yaagees; <verse eid="1CH 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12"/>heedzu laytha kosha woyko heedzu ageena ne morketa kushen aadhada imetanaysa woyko heedzu gallas Godaa mashshay ne biitta shocanaysanne gado Isra7eele bolla ehiya hayqo kiitancho kiitteysafe awusa dooray? Tana kiittidaysas odanaba taw oda” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13"/>Dawiti Gaadeko, “Taani daro un7etas. Godaa maarotay gita gidiya gisho taani iya kushen kundana; asa kushen kundike” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14"/>Hessa gisho, Goday Isra7eele bolla gado yeddin, 70,000 Isra7eele asati hayqidosona. <verse eid="1CH 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15"/>Xoossay Yerusalaame dhaysanaw kiitancho kiittis. Shin kiitanchoy Yerusalaame dhaysanaw doomida wode Goday azzanis. Dhaysiya kiitanchuwako, “Agga! Hiza gidana!” yaagis. He wode Godaa kiitanchoy Yaabuse addiya Orna wudumma matan eqis.<verse eid="1CH 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16"/>Kiitanchoy ba mashsha ba kushen oykidi Yerusalaame dhaysanaw sa7apenne salope giddon eqidaysa Dawiti be7is. He wode Dawitinne cimati kayo ma7o ma7idi, sa7an gufannidosona. <verse eid="1CH 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17"/>Dawiti, “Asay taybetana mela oothiday tana gidikina? Naaqidaynne iitabaa oothiday tana. Shin ha dorsati ay oothidona? Abeeti Godaw, ta Xoossaw, hayyana ne kushey tananne ta soo asaa seero. Ne kushey ne asaa seeropo!” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18"/>Godaa kiitanchoy Gaadeko haysada yaagis; “Dawiti Yaabuse addiya Orna wudumma bidi Godaas yarsho bessi gimbana mela oda” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19"/>Godaa sunthan Gaadi odidaysa si7idi Dawiti bis.<verse eid="1CH 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20"/>He wode Orninne iya oyddu adde nayti wudumman giste qoxoosona. I guye simmidi kiitancho be7is; iyara de7iya oyddu nayti be7idi qosetidosona. <verse eid="1CH 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21"/>Dawiti Ornako yida wode Orni iya be7idi, wudummaafe gaxa keyidi ziggidi sarothis.<verse eid="1CH 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22"/>Dawiti, “Gadoy asaa bollafe kichana mela taani Godaas yarsho bessi keexana mela ne wudumma taw bayza. Taani new kumetha gatiya qanxana” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23"/>Orni, “Eka; ta goday kawoy bana ufaysiyabaa ootho. Heko, boorat xuussa yarshos, katha bukiya miishiya eethanaw, giste kathaa yarshos immana. Taani ha ubbaa new immana” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24"/>Shin kawoy Dawiti, “Akay, taani kumetha gate qanxada shammana. Taani nebaanne ta miishen shammonnaba ekada xuussa yarsho oothada Godaas yarshike” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25"/>Dawiti wudumma usupun xeetu worqa santimen shammis. <verse eid="1CH 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26"/>Dawiti yan Godaas yarsho bessi keexis. Yaatidi xuussa yarshonne issifetetha yarsho yarshis. Godaa woossin, Goday xuussa yarshuwa bolla salope tama yeddidi iyaw zaaris.<verse eid="1CH 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27"/>Goday kiitanchuwa kiittin, kiitanchoy ba mashsha shoohuwan zaaris. <verse eid="1CH 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28"/>Dawiti, Goday iya woosa zaaridaysa be7idi, Yaabuse addiya Orna wudumman zaaridi yarshis. <verse eid="1CH 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29"/>Musey mela biittan giigisida, Godaa Dunkaaneynne xuussa yarsho bessay he wode Gaba7oonan goyinniya dhoqa bessan de7ees. <verse eid="1CH 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30"/>Shin Dawiti Godaa kiitanchuwa mashsha yayyida gisho Xoossaa oychanaw he bessaa baanaw danda7ibeenna.<verse eid="1CH 21:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti, “Godaa Xoossaa keethaynne Isra7eele asay xuussa yarsho bessay haysan gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keethi Keexanaw Giigetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2"/>Dawiti Isra7eele biittan de7iya bete asata shiishana mela kiittis. Xoossa keetha keexanaw shuchu masseysati massidi loythana mela enta giddofe dooris. <verse eid="1CH 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3"/>Dawiti, dirsa pengiya giigisanaw misimaarenne maxaafe qoxanaw daro biratanne zawi bayna naase birata giigisis. <verse eid="1CH 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4"/>Sidoonanne Xiroosa asati Dawitas ziga ehiya gisho Dawiti, tayboy bayna ziga giigisis. <verse eid="1CH 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5"/>Dawiti, “Ta na7ay Solomoney yooganne eratethan loohibeenna. Godaas keexetiya keethay biitta ubban eretidanne bonchetida lo77o keethe gidanaw bessees. Hessa gisho, iyaw koshshiyaba taani giigisana” yaagis. Dawiti hayqanaape sinthe darobaa giigisidi wothis.<verse eid="1CH 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti ba na7aa Solomone xeegidi, Godaas Isra7eele Xoossaas keethe keexana mela kiittis. <verse eid="1CH 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7"/>Dawiti Solomoneko, “Ta na7aw, taani Godaa ta Xoossaa sunthaas keethi keexanaw ta wozanan qopas. <verse eid="1CH 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8"/>Gidoshin, Godaa qaalay, ‘Neeni daro suuthi gussadasa; daro ola oletadasa. Neeni ha sa7aa bolla ta sinthan daro suuthi gussida gisho ta sunthaas keethe keexaka. <verse eid="1CH 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9"/>Gidoshin, saronne shempo gidida na7i yeletana; Iya yuushuwan de7iya morketape taani iya shempisana. Iya sunthay Solomone; taani iya kawotetha laythan Isra7eele asaas sarotethinne wopa immana. <verse eid="1CH 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10"/>I ta sunthaas keethe keexana. I ta na7a gidana; taani iyaw aawa gidana. Iya araata Isra7eelen merinaw minthada essana’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11"/>“Hiza ta na7aw, Goday neera gido. Godaa ne Xoossaa keetha keexana mela Goday kase odidaysada nena poliso. <verse eid="1CH 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12"/>Goday nena Isra7eele asaa bolla kawo oothiya wode, Godaa ne Xoossaa higgiya naagana mela Goday new cincatethinne akeeka immo. <verse eid="1CH 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13"/>Goday Muse baggara Isra7eele immida wogaanne kiitaa neeni naagiko ubbay new hanana. Minna; yayyofa; dagammofa, ufaysi qanxofa! <verse eid="1CH 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14"/>Taani taw danda7etida mela Godaa keetha keexanaw 3,400 kilo giraame worqa, 34,000 kilo giraame bira, zawi bayna naasenne birata shiishas; hessadaka mithinne shuchu giigisas. Neka ne baggara hessa bolla haraa gujanaw koshshees. <verse eid="1CH 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15"/>Ne matan daro oosanchoti shuchu qoo7eysatinne masseysati, anaaxetinne ubba ooso oothanaw danda7iya hiillanchoti de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16"/>Worqa, bira, naasenne birata oothiya asaas zawi baawa. Hiza neeni oosuwa dooma; Goday neera gido” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17"/>Isra7eele kaaletheysati ubbay ba na7aa Solomone maaddana mela Dawiti haysada yaagidi kiittis; <verse eid="1CH 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18"/>“Goday, hinte Xoossay ha77i gakanaw hintera de7eneyee? I hintena ubba baggara shempisibenneyee? Ha biittan de7iya asaa I ta kushen aathidi immida gisho ha biittay Godaasinne iya asaas haaretis. <verse eid="1CH 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19"/>Hiza Godaa hinte Xoossaa koyanaw hinte wozanaanne hinte shempuwa immite. Godaa sunthaas keexetida keethaa giddon Godaa caaqo Taabotiyanne Xoossaa geeshsha miisheta ehidi wothana mela dendidi Godaa Xoossaa keethaa keexite” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 22:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Leeweta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1"/>Dawiti cimida wode ba na7aa Solomone Isra7eele bolla kawothis.<verse eid="1CH 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2"/>Dawiti Isra7eele kaaletheyisata ubbaa, kahinetanne Leeweta issife shiishis. <verse eid="1CH 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3"/>Laythi hastamanne iyape bolla gidida Leeweti taybetidi kumethi 38,000 gididosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4"/>Entafe Godaa keetha aawatethan aysiya 24,000 leeweta kawoy wothis; 6,000 leeweta halaqatanne pirda daynnata oothidi wothis. <verse eid="1CH 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5"/>4,000 leeweta penge naageysata oothidi wothis. Qassi Godaa galatanaw Dawiti giigisida yetha miishen Godaa galatiya 4,000 leeweta wothis.<verse eid="1CH 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6"/>Dawiti Leewe adde nayta Gedisoona, Qahaatanne Maraara enta yaran yaran heedzu cugan shaakis.<verse eid="1CH 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="s2">Gedisoonata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7"/>Gedisoona adde nayti La7idanenne Sam7a. <verse eid="1CH 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8"/>La7idane heedzu adde nayti Yi7eela, Zetaamanne Iyyu7eela. <verse eid="1CH 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9"/>Same7a heedzu adde nayti Salomoota, Hazi7eelanne Harana; haysati La7idane yaraa halaqata. <verse eid="1CH 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10"/>Sama7a oyddu adde nayti Yahaata, Ziiza, Usanne Bar7a. <verse eid="1CH 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11"/>Usi bayraa, Ziizi kaalo. Shin Usasinne Bar7as nayti daronna gisho enti issi yarada taybetidosona.<verse eid="1CH 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s2">Qa7aateta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12"/>Qahaata oyddu adde nayti Anbaraama, Yisihaara, Kebroonanne Uzi7eela. <verse eid="1CH 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13"/>Anbaraama adde nayti Aaronanne Muse. Aaroninne iya kochay ubbaafe geeshshi gidana mela dummatidosona. Enti Godaa sinthan ixaane cuyisanaw, Godaas oothanawunne Godaa sunthan asaa anjanaw merinaw dummatidosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14"/>Xoossa ase gidida Muse nayta Leewe kochatara gathidi taybidosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15"/>Muse nayti Gedisoona Alaazara. <verse eid="1CH 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16"/>Gedisoona nayta giddofe halaqay Sabu7eela. <verse eid="1CH 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17"/>Alaazara na7ay Rahaaba. Alaazaras hara na7i baawa; shin Rahaabas nayti daro.<verse eid="1CH 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18"/>Yisihaara nayta halaqay Salomita. <verse eid="1CH 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19"/>Kebroona na7ay bayray Yiriya; kaaloy Amaare; heedzanthoy Yahazi7eela; oyddanthoy Yaqim7aama. <verse eid="1CH 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20"/>Uzi7eela bayra na7ay Mikiyaasa; kaaloy Yishiya.<verse eid="1CH 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="s2">Maraarata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21"/>Maraara nayti Mahilanne Musa. Mahila nayti Alaazaranne Qiisa. <verse eid="1CH 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22"/>Alaazari macca na7ape attishin, adde na7a yelonna hayqis. Hessa gisho, enta aawa ishaa Qiisa nayti enta machidosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23"/>Musa heedzu nayti Mahila, Ederanne Yiremoota.<verse eid="1CH 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24"/>Leewe yeletan banta kochaaninne soo asan banta sunthan mazgabetida Leewe kochati haysata. Laythi laatamanne iyape bolla gidida Leewe kochati ubbay Godaa Xoossaa keethan oothidosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25"/>Dawiti, “Goday, Isra7eele Xoossay ba asaa shempisis. Goday Yerusalaamen merinaw daana. <verse eid="1CH 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26"/>Leeweti Dunkaaniyanne iya giddon go7etiya miisheta hizape guye tookanaw bessenna” yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27"/>Dawita wursetha kiitan, laythi laatamanne iyape bolla gidida Leeweti taybetidosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28"/>Enti Godaa Xoossa keethan oothiya Aarona kochata maaddoosona. Godaa Xoossa keethan kareranne soora oothosona; geeshsha miishe ubbaa tunonna mela naagoosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29"/>Enti Xoossa sinthan wothiya uythaa, katha yarshos shiishiya dhiilliya, irshoy bayna uythaanne zaytera munuqetiya dhiilliya aawatethan aysoosona; Xoossa keethan maketiyabanne likeyabaa ubbaa aawatethan xeelloosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30"/>Qassi enti ubba gallas wontanne omarsi Godaa galatanawunne sabbanaw eqoosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31"/>Sambaata gallas, ageena xeeron, wogay kiittiya hara ba7aale gallasay gakiya wode Godaas xuussa yarsho yarshoosona. Entaw imetida taybuwadanne kiitaada ubba wode Godaa sinthan oothosona. <verse eid="1CH 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32"/>Dunkaaniyanne Godaa Xoossa keetha naagana melanne banta isha gidida, Aarona adde nayta, maaddana mela aawatethi Leewetas imetis.<verse eid="1CH 23:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Kahineta Ooso Shaahuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1"/>Aarona kochati banta ooso maaran haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. Aarona adde nayti Nadaaba, Abyooda, Alaazaranne Itamaara. <verse eid="1CH 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2"/>Shin Naadabeynne Abyooda na7a yelonna banta aawape sinthe hayqidosona. Hessa gisho, Alaazarinne Itamaari kahine gididosona. <verse eid="1CH 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3"/>Dawiti Alaazara yaraape Saadoqa, Itamaara yaraape Abimeleke ekidi Aarona kochata enta oosuwa maaran cugan cugan shaakis. <verse eid="1CH 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4"/>Alaazara yarata halaqati Itamaara yarata halaqatape dari bentida gisho Alaazara yarati tammanne usupun cugan shaaketin Itamaara yarati hospun cugan shaaketidosona. <verse eid="1CH 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5"/>Alaazara yarata giddoninne Itamaara yarata giddon Xoossa keetha halaqatinne Xoossa oosuwas bessiya halaqati de7iya gisho oosoy entaw saaman shaaketees. <verse eid="1CH 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6"/>Alaazara yaratinne Itamaara yarati banta maaran maaran saama kessidosona. Leewe koche gidida Natina7eela na7ay xaafey Shamayey enta mazgabees. Kawoynne iya moorinnati, kahiney Saadoqinne Abyataara na7ay Abimelekey, kahinetanne Leeweta yarata halaqati ubbay hessas marka.<verse eid="1CH 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7"/>Koyro saamay Yo7aaribas keyis; nam7anthoy Yadayas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8"/>Heedzanthoy Harimas keyis. Oyddanthoy Sa7oorimas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9"/>Ichashanthoy Malkiyas keyis. Usupunthoy Miyaaminas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10"/>Laapunthoy Aqoosas keyis; Hospunthoy Abiyas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11"/>Uddufunthoy Iyyasus keyis. Tammanthoy Sakanas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12"/>Tammanne issinthoy Eliyaseebas keyis. Tammanne nam7anthoy Yaqinas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13"/>Tammanne heedzanthoy Hupas keyis. Tammanne oyddanthoy Yeshebas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14"/>Tammanne ichashanthoy Bilgas keyis. Tammanne usupunthoy Imeras keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15"/>Tammanne laapunthoy Heziras keyis. Tammanne hospunthoy Hafixeexas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16"/>Tammanne uddufunthoy Patahas keyis. Laatamanthoy Yezekelas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17"/>Laatamanne issinthoy Yakinas keyis. Laatamanne nam7anthoy Gamulas keyis. <verse eid="1CH 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18"/>Laatamanne heedzanthoy Dalayas keyis. Laatamanne oyddanthoy Maazas keyis.<verse eid="1CH 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19"/>Goday Isra7eele Xoossay enta mayza Aarona kiittin, I entaw wothida wogaatho, banta Xoossa keetha geliya wode, enti oothana maaray haysa.<verse eid="1CH 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hara Leeweta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20"/>Hara Leewe kochata halaqati, haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:20">Yehidayi Sabu7eela baggara Amraama koche.<verse eid="1CH 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21"/>Yisheyi Rahaaba koche.<verse eid="1CH 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22"/>Yahaati Salomita baggara Yisihaara koche.<verse eid="1CH 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23"/>Yiriyey, Amaarey, Yahazi7eelinne Yiqam7aami Kebroona koche.<verse eid="1CH 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24"/>Shamiri Mikiyaasa baggara Uzi7eela koche.<verse eid="1CH 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25"/>Zakariyasi Mikiyaasa ishaa Yishiya baggara Uzi7eela koche.<verse eid="1CH 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26"/>Mahili, Musinne Ya7izi Maraara kochata. <verse eid="1CH 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27"/>Ya7iza heedzu adde nayti Shohaama, Zakuranne Ibara. <verse eid="1CH 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28"/>Mahila nam7u adde nayti Alaazaranne Qiisa. Alaazaras adde na7i baawa. <verse eid="1CH 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29"/>Qiisa Yirahima7eela geetetiya adde na7i de7ees. <verse eid="1CH 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30"/>Musa heedzu adde nayti Mahila, Ederanne Yiremoota.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:30">Haysati Leewe kochata halaqata.<verse eid="1CH 24:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31"/>Kase enta dabboti Aarona koche gidida kahineti oothidaysada haysatika kawoy Dawiti, Saadoqi, Abimelekey, kahinetanne Leeweta halaqati de7iya bessan saama yeggidosona. Bayraa ishaa soo asaasinne kaalo ishaa soo asaas issi gina saami wodhis.<verse eid="1CH 24:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keetha Zammaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1"/>Dawitinne Leeweta halaqati, Asaafa, Hemaananne Yedutuuna naytape suusul7en, diithaninne daalan tinbite odana mela dummayidosona. Ha oosuwas dummatida asaa sunthay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysa.<verse eid="1CH 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2"/>Asaafa nayti Zakura, Yoosefa, Naatananne Asar7eela. Asaafa nayti Asaafape garsara oothosona; Asaafi kawa kiitan tinbite odees.<verse eid="1CH 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3"/>Yedutuuna nayti Gadaaliya, Xaara, Yashaya, Sam7a, Hasabayanne Matita. Ha usupunati maasinqon Godaa galatishenne bonchishe banta aawa, nabiya Yedutuunape garsara kiitetoosona.<verse eid="1CH 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4"/>Hemaana nayti Buqaya, Mataana, Uzi7eela, Sabu7eela, Yarmoota, Hanaaniya, Hanaana, Eli7aata, Gidalta, Oromanti7ezera, Yoshbaqaasha, Maalota, Hotiranne Mazi7aata. <verse eid="1CH 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5"/>Haysati ubbay kawas qoncethi be7iya Hemaana nayta. Xoossay immana gidaysada Hemaana dhoqu dhoqu oothana mela ha tammanne oyddu adde naytanne heedzu macca nayta iyaw immis. <verse eid="1CH 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6"/>Haysati ubbay Xoossa keethan daala qaathanaw, diithinne maasinqo kaa7idi goyinnanaw banta aawape garsara de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 25:6">Asaafi, Yedutuuninne Hemaani kawuwape garsara de7oosona. <verse eid="1CH 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7"/>Hessati banta dabbotara gididi Xoossas shiiqiya mazmuren loohidaysata; enti kumethi 288. <verse eid="1CH 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8"/>Enti banta oosuwa shaakidi eranaw na7i cimi, astamaarey tamaarey shaahoy bayna saama yeggidosona.<verse eid="1CH 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9"/>Koyro saamay Asaafa na7aa Yoosefas keyis. Nam7antho saamay Gadallas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10"/>Heedzantho saamay Zakuras keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11"/>Oyddantho saamay Xaras keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12"/>Ichashantho saamay Nataanas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13"/>Usupuntho saamay Buqayas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14"/>Laapuntha saamay Yishira7eelas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15"/>Hospuntho saamay Yashayas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16"/>Uddufuntho saamay Matanas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17"/>Tammantho saamay Sam7as keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18"/>Tammanne issintho saamay Uzi7eelas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19"/>Tammanne nam7antho saamay Hasabayas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20"/>Tammanne heedzantho saamay Sabu7eelas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21"/>Tammanne oyddantho saamay Matitas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22"/>Tammanne ichashantho saamay Yarmootas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23"/>Tammanne usupuntho saamay Hanaana keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24"/>Tammanne laapuntho saamay Yoshibaqaashas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25"/>Tammanne hospuntho saamay Hanaaniyas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26"/>Tammanne uddufuntho saamay Maalotas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27"/>Laatamantho saamay Eli7aatas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28"/>Laatamanne issintho saamay Hotiras keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29"/>Laatamanne nam7antho saamay Gidaltas keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30"/>Laatamanne heedzantho saamay Mahzi7aata keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="1CH 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31"/>Laatamanne oyddantho saamay Oromanti7ezeras keyis; I, iya naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne nam7a.<verse eid="1CH 25:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keetha Penge Naageyisata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1"/>Xoossaa keetha pengiya naageysati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 26:1">Koyroy Qore kochaafe Asaafa adde naytape Qore na7a Masulaama. <verse eid="1CH 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2"/>Masulaami laapun adde nayta yelis; enti banta yeletaa maaran Zakariyasa, Yidi7eela, Yozobaata, Yatini7eela, <verse eid="1CH 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3"/>Elama, Yihoonanne Elhoona.<verse eid="1CH 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4"/>Xoossay Obeed-Edooma anjida gisho, I hospun adde nayta yelis. Enti banta yeletaa maaran Shamaya, Yozabaata, Iyo7aasa, Sakara, Natina7eela, <verse eid="1CH 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5"/>Ami7eela, Yisakooranne Pulaata. <verse eid="1CH 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6"/>Obeed-Edooma na7ay Shamayey usupun adde nayta yelis; enti mino asi gidida gisho, banta aawa soo asaas halaqa gididosona. <verse eid="1CH 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7"/>Shamaya nayti Otina, Rafa7eela, Yobeedanne Elzabaada; enta ishati Elihuynne Samaki qara asata. <verse eid="1CH 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8"/>Haysati ubbay Obeed-Edooma kochata; enti, enta naytanne enta dabboti oosos mino. Obeed-Edooma kochati kumethi usupun tammanne nam7a.<verse eid="1CH 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9"/>Masulaamas mino naytinne mino dabboti de7oosona; enti kumethi tammanne hospuna.<verse eid="1CH 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10"/>Maraara yaraape Hosa geetetiya addiyas oyddu adde nayti de7oosona. Shimiri bayra na7a gidenna, shin iya aaway iya halaqa oothis. <verse eid="1CH 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11"/>Iya ishati Kalqe, Zabalanne Zakariyasa. Hosa naytinne iya dabboti kumethi tammanne heedza.<verse eid="1CH 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12"/>Xoossa keetha pengiya naageysati banta soo asaa halaqata cugan cugan shaaketidosona. Hara Leewetada entaka Xoossa keetha oosoy shaahon gakis. <verse eid="1CH 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13"/>Issi issi pengiya naaganaw banta soo asan asan na7a cima goonna saama yeggidosona. <verse eid="1CH 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14"/>Doloha Pengiya naaganaw saamay Salamas keyis. Lo77o zore zoriya iya na7aa Zakariyasa pudeha Pengiya naaganaw saami keyis. <verse eid="1CH 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15"/>Obeed-Edoomas dugeha pengiya naaganaw saami keyis. Iya naytas buqura minjiya keethaa naaganaw saami keyis. <verse eid="1CH 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16"/>Wuloha pengiyanne qommo baggara de7iya Shalekota pengiya naaganaw saami Sufimasinne Hosas keyis. Naagoy maaran maaran gakees.<verse eid="1CH 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17"/>Gallas gallas doloha baggara usupun, pudeha baggara oydda, dugeha baggara oyddu Leeweti naagoosona. Qassi buqura minjiya keethaa nam7u nam7u Leeweti naagoosona. <verse eid="1CH 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18"/>Wuloha baggara dabaabako efiya ogiya oyddu, qassi dabaaba nam7u Leeweti naagoosona. <verse eid="1CH 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19"/>Hiza Qoresinne Maraara kochaas imetida penge naago oosoy haysa.<verse eid="1CH 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minja Keetha Shuumata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20"/>Akiya geetetiya Leewey Xoossa keethan de7iya buquranne Xoossas dummayi wothida imotata naaganaw shuumetis. <verse eid="1CH 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21"/>Gedisoona na7aa Laadanna yaraape Yi7eeli dumma dumma soo asaas aawates. <verse eid="1CH 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22"/>Yi7eela nayti Zetaamanne iya ishaa Iyyu7eela; enti Xoossa keethan de7iya buqura naaganaw shuumetidosona.<verse eid="1CH 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23"/>Amraama, Yisihaara, Kebroonanne Uzi7eela yaratas oosoy shaaketidi imetis. <verse eid="1CH 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24"/>Muse na7aa Gedisoona yara gidida Sabu7eeli Xoossa keethan de7iya buqura naageysata halaqata bolla shuumetis. <verse eid="1CH 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25"/>I Gedisoona ishaa Alaazara baggara Salomootas dabbo. Al77azari Rahaabiya yelis; Rahaabi Yeshaya yelis; Yeshayi Yoraama yelis; Yoraami Zikira yelis; Zikiri Salomita yelis. <verse eid="1CH 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26"/>Salomootinne iya dabboti kawoy Dawiti, iya soo asaa halaqati, shaalaqati, mato halaqatinne toora moconata Xoossas dummayida miishe ubbaa bolla shuumetidosona. <verse eid="1CH 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27"/>Ha asati olan di7etidi yida miishetape baggaa Xoossa keethan dummayidi wothidosona. <verse eid="1CH 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28"/>Qoncethi be7iya Sameeli, Qiisa na7ay Saa7oli, Neera na7ay Abeneerinne Xaruya na7ay Iyo7aabi kase dummayidi wothida imota ubbaa Salomootinne iya dabboti naagoosona.<verse eid="1CH 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29"/>Yisihaara yaratape Kanaaneynne iya nayti Xoossa keethafe karera de7iya ooson Isra7eele asaa aysanawunne daynnatanaw shuumetidosona.<verse eid="1CH 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30"/>Kebroona yaratape Hashabinne iya dabboti 1,700 mino asati, Godaa oosuwasinne kawa oosuwas Yordaanosepe wuloha baggara de7iya Isra7eele asaa bolla shuumetidosona. <verse eid="1CH 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31"/>Kebroona yarata mazgabiya maaran Yiriyi enta halaqa. Dawiti kawotida oytamantho laythan mazgaben koyin enta asaa giddofe mino asati Galada biittan Ya7izeera geetetiya bessan bentidosona. <verse eid="1CH 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32"/>Enta soo asaas halaqa gidida Yiriya dabboti minoti 2,700. Kawoy Dawiti Xoossa oosuwasinne kawa oosuwas Robeela, Gaadenne Minaase kochatape baggata bolla enta shuumis.<verse eid="1CH 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Toora Moconata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1"/>Banta cugan cugan kawotethaa aysiya Isra7eele soo asaa halaqati, shaalaqatinne mato halaqati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. Issi issi cugan 24,000 asati de7oosona. Issi issi cugay laythan issi ageena maaran maaran kawotetha ooso oothanaw keyees.<verse eid="1CH 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2"/>Koyro ageenan keya cugaa kaalethey Zabdi7eela na7aa Yashobi7aama; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees. <verse eid="1CH 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3"/>Yashobi7aami Paaresa koche; I koyro ageenas tora moconata.<verse eid="1CH 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4"/>Nam7antho ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey Ahoha addiya Dodaya; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees. He cugaa kaalethiya nam7antho halaqay Mikloota.<verse eid="1CH 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5"/>Heedzantho ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey kahiniya Yoodahe na7aa Banaya; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees. <verse eid="1CH 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6"/>Banayi hastamu eretida asata giddon mino asi; qassi hastamata halaqa. Iya bessan iya na7ay Amzabadi halaqa gidis.<verse eid="1CH 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7"/>Oyddantho ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey Iyo7aaba ishaa Asaheela; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees. Iya bessan iya na7ay Zabadi halaqa gidis.<verse eid="1CH 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8"/>Ichashantho ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey Yisihaara yaraape Shamhuuta; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9"/>Usupuntho ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey Tequhe addiya Iska na7aa Ira; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10"/>Laapuntha ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey Efreema koche gidida Piloona addiya Selesa; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11"/>Hospuntha ageenan keyiya cuga kaalethey Husha addiya Sibakaya; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees. Sibakayi Yihuda kochenne Zaara yara.<verse eid="1CH 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12"/>Uddufuntho ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey Biniyaame koche gidida Anatoote addiya Abi7ezera; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13"/>Tammantho ageenan keyiya cuga kaalethey Naxoofa addiya Zaara yara gidida Mahira; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14"/>Tammanne issintho ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey Efreema koche gidida Pir7atoona addiya Banaya; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15"/>Tammanne nam7antho ageenan keyiya cugaa kaalethey Gotoniyala yaraape gidida Naxoofa Heldaya; iya cugan 24,000 asi de7ees.<verse eid="1CH 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Moorinnata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16"/>Isra7eele kochata aysanaw shuumetidaysati haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:16">Robeela kochaa aysey Zikira na7aa Alaazara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:16">Simoona kochaa aysey Ma7ika na7aa Safaaxa.<verse eid="1CH 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17"/>Leewe kochaa aysey Qamu7eela na7aa Hasabaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:17">Aarona kochaa aysey Saadoqa.<verse eid="1CH 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18"/>Yihuda kochaa aysey Dawita ishaa Elihu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:18">Yisakoora kochaa aysey Mika7eela na7aa Omira.<verse eid="1CH 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19"/>Zabloona kochaa aysey Abdiyu na7aa Yashimaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:19">Niftaaleme kochaa aysey Azri7eela na7aa Yarmoota.<verse eid="1CH 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20"/>Efreema kochaa aysey Azaaza na7aa Hose7a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:20">Minaase kochaafe baggaa aysey Padaya na7aa Iyyu7eela.<verse eid="1CH 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21"/>Galadan de7iya Minaase kochaafe baggaa aysey Zakariyasa na7aa Ido.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:21">Biniyaame kochaa aysey Abeneera na7aa Ye7isi7eela.<verse eid="1CH 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22"/>Daane kochaa aysey Yirohaama na7aa Azari7eela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:22">Haysati Isra7eele kochaa ayseysata.<verse eid="1CH 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23"/>Goday Isra7eele asaa salo xoolintoda darsana gida gisho Dawiti laatamu laythinne iyape garsara de7eyisata taybon gelsibeenna. <verse eid="1CH 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24"/>Xaruya na7ay Iyo7aabi asaa taybo doomidi wursonna aggis. Asaa taybida gisho Goday Isra7eele asaa bolla hanqetida gisho enta tayboy kawa Dawita taarike mazgaben xaafetibeenna.<verse eid="1CH 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawa Buqura Aysiya Asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25"/>Kawo buqura minjiya bessaa aawatethan aysiya asaa sunthay haysafe kaallidi xaafetidaysata. Adi7eela na7aa Azmooti kawo keetha buqura aawatethan aysees.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:25">Ooziyana na7ay Yoonataani gaxaren, katamaninne gutan de7iya kawo keetha miisheta aawatethan aysees. <verse eid="1CH 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26"/>Kaluba na7ay Iziri goshshanchota aawatethan aysees. <verse eid="1CH 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27"/>Rama addey Same7i woyne gadeta aawatethan aysees. Safaama addey Zabdi woyne ushsha minjiya keethaa aawatethan aysees.<verse eid="1CH 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28"/>Gadara addey Ba7al-Hanani zuma bolla de7iya zayte shamahuwanne boobba aawatethan aysees. Zayte wothiya keethaa aawatethan aysey Iyo7aasa. <verse eid="1CH 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29"/>Saarona denban heemetiya mehiya aawatethan aysey Saarona addiya Saxira. Zangaaran heemetiya mehiya aawatethan aysey Adilaya na7aa Shaafaxa. <verse eid="1CH 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30"/>Gimaleta aawatethan aysey Isma7eela addiya Ubisa. Hareta aawatethan aysey Meronoota addiya Yehidaya. <verse eid="1CH 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31"/>Dorsatanne deeshata aawatethan aysey Agara addey Yaziza. Haysati ubbay Dawita shaluwa bolla aawateyisata.<verse eid="1CH 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32"/>Dawita aawa ishay, xaafey Yoonataani akeekanne kawa zoriya asi. Hakmoona na7ay Yi7eeli kawa nayta tamaarsees. <verse eid="1CH 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33"/>Akxoofeli kawa zoreysa. Arka addey Kuussi kawa lagge. <verse eid="1CH 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34"/>Akxoofeli hayqin, iya bessan Banaya na7ay Yodaaheynne Abyataari kawa zoriya asi gididosona; Iyo7aabi kawa toora mocona.<verse eid="1CH 27:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keetha Halchuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1"/>Isra7eele halaqati ubbay Yerusalaamen shiiqana mela kawoy Dawiti kiittis. Hessa gisho, issi issi kochaa halaqati, kawo moorinnati, shaalaqati, mato halaqati, kawuwasinne kawa naytas de7iya shaluwanne mehiya ayseysati, kawo gadhon ootheysati, eretidanne mino asati ubbay Yerusalaamen shiiqidosona.<verse eid="1CH 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2"/>Kawoy Dawiti dendi eqidi haysada yaagis; “Ta ishato, ta asaw, si7ite! Godaa caaqo Taabotiya wothiyanne nu Xoossaa tohoy shempiya keethaa keexanaw ta wozanan qopas; koshshiyaba ubbaa giigisas. <verse eid="1CH 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3"/>Shin Xoossay, ‘Neeni olanchonne suuthi gussida asi gidiya gisho ta sunthaas keethe keexaka’ yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4"/>Taani Isra7eele bolla merinaw kawotanaada, Goday Isra7eele Xoossay ta aawa soope tana dooris. Kaalethanaada koyro Yihuda kochaa dooris; Yihuda kochaafe ta aawa soo asaa dooris; ta aawa nayta giddofe tana dooridi Isra7eele ubbaa bolla kawoyanaw dosis. <verse eid="1CH 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5"/>Goday taw daro nayta immis; ta nayta ubbaafe Godaa kawotetha araatan uttidi Isra7eele bolla kawotanaada ta na7aa Solomone dooris.<verse eid="1CH 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6"/>“Goday, ‘Ta keethaanne ta dabaaba keexanay ne na7aa Solomone. I taw na7a gidana mela taani iya dooras; taani iyaw aawa gidana. <verse eid="1CH 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7"/>I ha77i ootheysada ta kiitaanne ta higgiya minnidi naagiko taani iya kawotethaa merinaw minthana’ yaagis. <verse eid="1CH 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8"/>Hiza Godaa shiiqo gidida Isra7eele asa ubbay be7ishin, nu Xoossay si7ishin, Godaa hinte Xoossaa kiita ubbaa hinte minthidi naagana mela taani hintew odayis. Yaatiko, hinte ha lo77o biitta laattana; hinte naytaka merinaw laatisana.<verse eid="1CH 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9"/>“Solomone, ta na7aw, Xoossay asa wozananne qofa ubbaa eriya gisho ne aawa Xoossaa era; kumetha wozananinne shenen iyaw ootha. Neeni iya koyiko I new bentana; shin neeni iya aggiko I nena merinaw aggana. <verse eid="1CH 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10"/>Xoossaa keetha keexana mela Goday nena dooridaysa dogopa; ooso ubbaa minnada ootha” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti ba na7aa Solomones Xoossa keethaa, barandaa, buqura minjiya keethaa, pooqiyanne giddo kifileta, hessadaka nagara atotetha kama wothiya kifiliya halchuwanne qofaa immis. <verse eid="1CH 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12"/>Dawiti Godaa keetha dabaaba keexanaw ba wozanan de7iya qofaa, iya yuushuwan de7iya ubba kifileta halchuwanne Xoossa keethaa buqura wothiya kifiliyanne Godaas dummatida imotata wothiya kifileta oosuwa qofaa immis.<verse eid="1CH 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13"/>Hessadaka Dawiti kahinetanne Leeweta ooso maara, Xoossa keetha ooso maaranne Xoossa keetha miisheta naagiya maara odiya qofaa iyaw immis.<verse eid="1CH 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14"/>Dumma dumma oosos go7etiya miisheta oothanaw maaddiya worqanne bira mizaanen likisidi Solomones immis. <verse eid="1CH 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15"/>Hessika xompe wothiya worqa kocatanne iya xompeta, xompe wothiya bira kocatanne iya xompeta, <verse eid="1CH 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16"/>Godaa sinthan uythu wothiya worqa xarpheezata, bira xarpheezata, <verse eid="1CH 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17"/>worqa qapheta, worqa kereta, worqa wancata, worqa xaarota, bira xaarota <verse eid="1CH 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18"/>ixaane cuyisiya geeshsha worqa saaxine, Godaa caaqo Taabotiya bolla banta qefiya miccidi kammiya kiruubeta wothiya worqa gaariya giigisiya halchuwa iyaw immis. <verse eid="1CH 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19"/>Dawiti, “Goday ba kushiya ta bolla wothidi ha xaafetida qofa ubbaa tana erisis” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20"/>Dawiti ba na7aa Solomoneko, “Hiza minna! Oosuwa ootha! Goday ta Xoossay neera de7iya gisho yayyofa; dagammofa! Xoossa keetha oosoy poletana gakanaw Xoossay nena yeggennanne aggenna. <verse eid="1CH 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21"/>Xoossa keethan de7iya ooso ubbaas kahinetinne Leeweti shuumetidosona. Kushe hiilli de7iya asa ubbay nena ooso ubban maaddana. Halaqatinne asa ubbay new kiitetana” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 28:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keethaas Imetida Imotata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1"/>Hessafe guye, Kawoy Dawiti shiiqida asa ubbaa haysada yaagis; “Xoossay doorida ta na7aa Solomoney yooganne eratethan loohibeenna. Ha keexetana keethay asa keethi gidonashin Godaa Xoossaa keethi gidiya gisho oosoy gita. <verse eid="1CH 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2"/>Taani taw de7iya wolqa mela ta Xoossa keethaas worqan oosetiyabas worqaa, biran oosetiyabas bira, naase biratan oosetiyabas, naase birata, biratan oosetiyaba biratanne mithan oosetiyabas mithi giigisa wothas. Qassi margide, ibnebarade, dumma dumma mali de7iya alleeqo shuchata, al7o shuchatanne hara shuchata giigisada wothas. <verse eid="1CH 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3"/>Xoossa keetha taani daro dosiya gisho, taani ta Xoossa keethaas giigisidaysafe hara ta buzo shaluwape worqanne bira immas. <verse eid="1CH 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4"/>Keethaa godaa lanxanaw 100,000 kilo giraame Ofira worqanne 240,000 kilo giraame walahi bayna bira immas. <verse eid="1CH 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5"/>Kushe hiillanchoti oothana ooso ubbaas worqan oosetiyabas worqaa, biran oosetiyabas bira immas. Yaatin, hachi hintefe ba shenen bana Godaas dummayey oonee?” yaagis.<verse eid="1CH 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6"/>Isra7eele kochata soo asaa halaqati, kochata halaqati, shaalaqati, mato halaqatinne kawo moorinnati banta shenen bantaw de7iyaba dosan immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7"/>Enti Xoossa keetha oosuwas 170,000 kilo giraame worqaa, 340,000 kilo giraame bira, 620,000 kilo giraame naase biratanne 3,000,000 kilo giraame birata immidosona. <verse eid="1CH 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8"/>Al77o shuchi de7iya asa ubbay buqura aysiya Gedisoona yara gidida Yi7eela baggara Godaa Xoossa keetha buqura minjiya keethaas immis. <verse eid="1CH 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9"/>Asay ba shenen ba kumetha wozanan Godaas immida gisho ufaytis; kawoy Dawitika daro ufaytis.<verse eid="1CH 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10"/>Hessa gisho, Dawiti deriya ubbaa sinthan haysada yaagidi Godaa galatis; “Abeeti Godaw, nu aawa Isra7eele Xoossaw neeni merinaape merinaw galateta. <verse eid="1CH 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11"/>Abeeti Godaw, saloninne sa7an de7iya ubbay nebaa! Gitatethi, wolqi, bonchoy, xoonoynne angi nebaa! Abeeti Godaw, maati nebaa; neeni ubbaafe bollanne huuphe. <verse eid="1CH 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12"/>Duretethinne bonchoy neepe yees; neeni ubbaba haarasa. Wolqinne minotethi ne kushena; neeni asa ubbaa gitanne mino oothanaw danda7aasa. <verse eid="1CH 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13"/>Ha77ika nu Xoossaw, nuuni nena galatoos; ne boncho sunthaa sabboos.<verse eid="1CH 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14"/>“Nuuni haysa mela immanaw tanne ta asay oonee? Ubbay neepe yees; nuuni ne kushepe ekidaba new zaaridi immida. <verse eid="1CH 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15"/>Kase nu aawatada nuka ne sinthan bete asinne imathe. Ha sa7an nu de7o laythay ufaysi bayna kuya mela. <verse eid="1CH 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16"/>Abeeti Godaw, nu Xoossaw, ne geeshsha sunthaas nuuni keethe keexanaw shiishida ubbay ne kushepe yidaba; ubbay nebaa.<verse eid="1CH 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17"/>“Ta Xoossaw neeni wozanaa paaceysanne suuretethi doseysa taani erayis. Taani ta wozana suuretethan ta shenen hessa ubbaa immas. Ha bessan de7iya ne asay new ba shenen ufaysan immidaysa taani be7as. <verse eid="1CH 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18"/>Abeeti Godaw, nu mayzata Abrahaame, Yisaaqanne Isra7eele Xoossaw, ne asaa wozanan ha gita siiquwa merinaw naaga; enta wozanaa neeko zaara. <verse eid="1CH 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19"/>Ne wogaa, ne kiitaanne ne higgiya naagana melanne taani qopada giigisadaban Xoossa keetha keexana mela ta na7aa Solomones kumetha wozana imma” yaagidi woossis.<verse eid="1CH 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti deriyako, “Godaa hinte Xoossaa galatite” yaagis. Dere ubbay Godaa banta aawata Xoossaa galatidosona. Sa7an gufannidi Godaa goyinnidosona; kawuwasika boncho immidosona.<verse eid="1CH 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomoney Kawo Gideysi Eretis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21"/>Wontetha gallas asay yarshonne xuussa yarsho Godaas yarshidosona. Hessika issi mukulu kormaa, issi mukulu maraze, issi mukulu dorsa urge, ushsha yarshonne hara daro yarsho yarshidosona. <verse eid="1CH 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22"/>Asay he gallas Godaa sinthan daro ufaytidi misinne uyis. Yaatidi asay kawa Dawita na7aa Solomone nam7antho zayte tiyidi iya kawotethan minthis. Saadoqa kahine gidana mela Godaa sinthan tiyidosona.<verse eid="1CH 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23"/>Hessafe guye, Solomoney ba aawa Dawita bessan Godaa kawotetha araatan uttis. Iyaw ubbabay injetis; Isra7eele ubbay iyaw kiitetidosona. <verse eid="1CH 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24"/>Halaqati, mino asatinne kawa Dawita nayti kawa Solomones kiitetanaw qaala gelidosona. <verse eid="1CH 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25"/>Goday Solomone Isra7eele asa ubbaa sinthan dhoqu dhoqu oothis; kase Isra7eele kawotas imetiboonna boncho Solomones immis.<verse eid="1CH 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26"/>Isseye na7ay Dawiti Isra7eele ubbaa bolla kawotis. <verse eid="1CH 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27"/>Dawiti Isra7eele bolla oytamu laythi kawotis; Kebroonan laapun laythi, Yerusalaamen hastamanne heedzu laythi kawotis. <verse eid="1CH 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28"/>Dawiti daro laythi de7idi, duretidi, bonchetidi, lo77o cimidi hayqis. Iya bessan iya na7ay Solomoney kawotis. <verse eid="1CH 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29"/>Dawiti koyrope doomidi wursethi gakanaw oothidabay, qoncethi be7iya Sameela, nabiya Naatananne qoncethi be7iya Gaade taarike maxaafan xaafetis. <verse eid="1CH 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30"/>I waati haaridako, waanida wolqaama aseeko, I oothidabay, Isra7eele asaynne heeran de7iya kawotethati ubbay hanidabay he maxaafatan xaafetis.<verse eid="1CH 29:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29"/>
</usx>
